WEBVTT

asr-000003
00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:19.920
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Session suspended.

asr-000044
00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:52.800
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed. Majority.

asr-000044-split-2
00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.800
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker, Madam Speaker.

asr-000044-split-3
00:20:56.800 --> 00:20:58.600
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: What's the pleasure of the Honorable Tiangco?

asr-000044-split-4
00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:01.760
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Parliamentary inquiry, Madam Speaker.

asr-000045
00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:05.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: What's the parliamentary inquiry of the Honorable Tiangco?

asr-000045-split-2
00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:15.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker, gusto ko lang po malaman kung bakit nilipat po from September 24 ang budget ng House at naging September 17 po.

asr-000045-split-3
00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:19.120
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Your question is bakit nilipat yung—

asr-000045-split-4
00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:33.630
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Sa original schedule po na nilabas noong September 15, ang original schedule po ng budget ng House is on September 24. Ang nangyari po niyan, inilipat po yan ng September 17.

asr-000046
00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:37.440
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So ang tanong ko po, ano po ang dahilan kung bakit po ito nilipat ng September 17?

asr-000046-split-2
00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:48.390
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: May we know from the Majority Leader if this is the only agency that the schedule has been changed or it encompasses other agencies as well?

asr-000047
00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:52.000
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Madam Speaker, it wasn't the only agency that was moved.

asr-000048
00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:59.820
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: I think there were several other agencies that were moved due to requests from the other departments.

asr-000049
00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:02.780
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: It was actually the deferment of two agencies.

asr-000050
00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:04.640
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: No, Madam Speaker, can you please name the agency that was moved?

asr-000051
00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:10.120
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Because based on my record, ito lang po ang inusod. Ito lang po ang in-advance na ahensya.

asr-000052
00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:16.760
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: So kung meron po, pwede pong sabihin kung ano pong ahensya yung inusod ng mas maaga yung schedule, Madam Speaker.

asr-000053
00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:21.800
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of the Honorable Toby Chango, can we proceed to the additional reference of business?

asr-000054
00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.120
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: No, Madam Speaker, I do not agree.

asr-000055
00:22:24.640 --> 00:22:26.220
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: While we are getting the data.

asr-000056
00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:27.940
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: No, no, no, I do not agree. Let's suspend.

asr-000057
00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session suspended.

asr-000058
00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:05.240
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed.

asr-000059
00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:08.080
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Majority Leader.

asr-000060
00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:19.500
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Madam Speaker, upon review of the schedule, the DOT, the PSA, and the Congress of the Philippines budget were all moved to a different schedule.

asr-000061
00:23:20.340 --> 00:23:22.920
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Madam Speaker, the DOT was moved to a later schedule.

asr-000062
00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:29.420
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Ang tanong ko, bakit, kasi tignan niyo po, Madam Speaker, September 17 po nun, okay?

asr-000063
00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:34.120
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: September 17, meron po naman nakaschedule ng September 18.

asr-000064
00:23:34.580 --> 00:23:38.220
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Meron nakaschedule ng September 21, 22, 23.

asr-000065
00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:41.060
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Bakit naman doon tayo sa dulo kukuha, Madam Speaker?

asr-000066
00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:46.460
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Traditionally, matagal na kayo dito, pag nag-uusod, ang kinukuha yung pinakmalapit.

asr-000067
00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:47.280
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: For what reason?

asr-000068
00:23:47.720 --> 00:23:52.620
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Para makapaghanda po yung hindi lang yung departamento, kung hindi pa rin yung mga congressmen.

asr-000069
00:23:52.620 --> 00:23:59.840
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Kasi bakit naman po maghahanda yung congressman na mag-deliberate sa isang budget na tatalakayin pa sa September 24?

asr-000070
00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:05.540
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Siyempre, tatalakang pag-aaralan niyo po yung September 17, September 18. Una po yan.

asr-000071
00:24:05.960 --> 00:24:09.360
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: With the indulgence of the Honorable Tavi Chanko, if you may,

asr-000072
00:24:10.140 --> 00:24:15.400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: this schedule, as arranged by the Committee on Appropriations, is not deliberated in the plenary.

asr-000073
00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:18.540
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: This is being discussed within the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-000074
00:24:18.820 --> 00:24:26.960
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: So, with the indulgence of the Honorable Tavi Chanko, if he deems it proper, he can move for the session suspended.

asr-000196
01:21:30.000 --> 01:21:40.680
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Session resumed. Majority Leader.

asr-000196-split-2
01:21:40.680 --> 01:21:42.600
Rep. Marie Bernadette G. Escudero: Madam Speaker, I move to call the roll of members.

asr-000196-split-3
01:21:42.600 --> 01:21:48.280
