asr-000196-split-4
01:21:48.280 --> 01:21:51.600
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker.

asr-000196-split-5
01:21:51.600 --> 01:21:52.800
Secretary-General: Roll call of members.

asr-000196-split-6
01:21:52.800 --> 01:21:56.400
Rep. Tobias "Toby" M. Tiangco: Madam Speaker, I still have the floor.

asr-000196-split-7
01:21:56.400 --> 01:22:00.400
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: In due time, Honorable Tiangco. Roll call is ongoing; it is the highest motion.

asr-000197
01:22:00.400 --> 01:22:05.520
