asr-001785
03:15:30.000 --> 03:15:40.860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So, sa ngayon po, because it involves a lot of agencies, tinatrabaho na po.

asr-001786
03:15:41.760 --> 03:15:46.340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Ang ginagawa ng ano, ito yung mga observation na dapat baguhin.

asr-001787
03:15:47.200 --> 03:15:51.180
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung use of aliases or code names.

asr-001788
03:15:52.740 --> 03:15:56.860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung tungkol sa evidence of success, yung mga rewards.

asr-001789
03:15:58.120 --> 03:15:59.860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Tungkol sa mga allowed experiences.

asr-001790
03:16:00.000 --> 03:16:06.380
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka yung hanggang saan ang clearance ng auditor.

asr-001791
03:16:07.480 --> 03:16:09.340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Security clearance ng mga auditor.

asr-001792
03:16:11.080 --> 03:16:15.420
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: At saka yung paggamit ng mga generic acknowledgement receipts.

asr-001793
03:16:16.780 --> 03:16:20.880
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So, ito po ang mga pagbabago na ginagawa ngayon.

asr-001794
03:16:21.060 --> 03:16:22.220
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Working progress po ito.

asr-001795
03:16:22.640 --> 03:16:27.820
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: As to when, I think, within the soonest possible time.

asr-001796
