Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Mr. Speaker, it is Congress, tayo po mismo,

asr-001803
03:17:10.560 --> 03:17:21.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: ang naggawa ng mga guidelines through our GAA for what we call the Provisional Conditions.

asr-001804
03:17:21.720 --> 03:17:28.340
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Tayo mismo, sino yung dapat bigyan at hindi bigyan.

asr-001805
03:17:28.840 --> 03:17:29.000
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So,

asr-001806
03:17:30.000 --> 03:17:34.020
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: that is yung ginagawa natin.

asr-001807
03:17:34.200 --> 03:17:35.480
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yan ang ginagawa natin.

asr-001808
03:17:35.880 --> 03:17:40.760
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Tayo mismo ang nag-identify sinong bigyan at saka hindi bigyan.

asr-001809
03:17:42.760 --> 03:17:43.360
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So...

asr-001810
