Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Or hindi, allowed.

asr-001823
03:18:49.940 --> 03:18:52.540
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So, yun po ang mga minamungkahi ng COA, no?

asr-001824
03:18:52.940 --> 03:18:55.320
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Regards this Confi and Intelligence Fund.

asr-001825
03:18:57.680 --> 03:18:59.120
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yung IDUS naman,

asr-001826
03:19:00.000 --> 03:19:03.900
