Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pareho lang sa mga empleyado, therefore, may hangganan din po, no?

asr-002273
03:36:41.540 --> 03:36:41.720
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Yes.

asr-002274
03:36:42.220 --> 03:36:42.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-002275
03:36:43.340 --> 03:37:01.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sige, intayin na lang po natin. Pero ito na po ang tanong. Ibig po sabihin, panapanahon lang. So, tuloy pa rin po, for the most part, the COA can say na nagagampanan pa rin ni Commissioner Lipana ang kanyang tungkulin.

asr-002276
03:37:03.520 --> 03:37:12.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is he still able to discharge his duties as COA Commissioner despite his health condition?

asr-002277
03:37:13.340 --> 03:37:23.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That requires him to avail of sick leave periodically, every month, apparently. Nagagampanan pa rin po ba niya, ang kanyang mga tungkulin bilang Commissioner?

asr-002278
03:37:27.720 --> 03:37:31.260
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Nagagampanan po naman ni Commissioner Lipana yung trabaho niya.

asr-002279
03:37:31.680 --> 03:37:39.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagagampanan po. So, in other words, the Commission en banc, yung tatlong miyembro, ay fully functioning.

asr-002280
03:37:40.600 --> 03:37:42.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ibig sabihin, kung nangangailangan ng…

asr-002281
03:37:43.340 --> 03:37:58.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Decision, no? Merong mga resolution o merong mga kaso. Halimbawa, itong Notice of Disallowance, ay available po yung tatlong Commissioner at yung tatlong nagpapasya. Ganun pa rin po?

asr-002282
03:38:00.760 --> 03:38:13.220
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kahit po wala si Commissioner Lipana, ang Commission itself, nagagampanan namin nila yung remaining dalawang Commissioner, they are still doing their… they can do their job.

asr-002283
03:38:13.340 --> 03:38:14.860
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Even without Commissioner Lipana.

asr-002284
03:38:14.880 --> 03:38:24.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, they can do their jobs. I have no doubt, they can do their jobs. Pero ang tanong ko lang po, hindi po ba may mga pagkakataon na kailangan yung buong Commission? O sapat na yung dalawa?

asr-002285
03:38:26.800 --> 03:38:35.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano halimbawa, kung merong opinion na magkaiba yung dalawa, how will that be settled? Wala bang ganun?

asr-002286
03:38:37.300 --> 03:38:42.420
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: So far naman po, sapat na po yung…

asr-002287
03:38:43.340 --> 03:38:49.640
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Dalawa. So far, no? Wala naman silang mga pagtunggali between their opinions.

asr-002288
03:38:49.640 --> 03:39:03.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so far wala. And para malinawan lang po, pwede po ba mag-issue ng mga resolution, decision, and so on, ang en banc na dalawa lang sa tatlo ang nakapirma? Pwede na yun?

asr-002289
03:39:04.380 --> 03:39:04.920
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Pwede po.

asr-002290
03:39:05.380 --> 03:39:09.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pwede? Dahil ang requirement, basta majority, ganun po ba?

asr-002291
03:39:10.260 --> 03:39:11.040
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Majority po.

asr-002292
03:39:11.040 --> 03:39:12.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ah, okay. Alright.

asr-002293
03:39:13.340 --> 03:39:28.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ngayon, kung sakaling umabot po sa, sabi nyo, merong notice of disallowance involving the wife of Commissioner Lipana na nasa lower level pa, no?

asr-002294
03:39:28.140 --> 03:39:30.020
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Cluster 7 po. Cluster 7.

asr-002295
03:39:30.120 --> 03:39:35.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Cluster 7. Eventually, tama po, aabot yan sa en banc. Tama po ba?

asr-002296
03:39:36.260 --> 03:39:37.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po mangyayari?

asr-002297
03:39:38.180 --> 03:39:42.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Will the Commissioner Lipana be involved in…

asr-002298
03:39:43.340 --> 03:39:46.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Be decision-making on that resolution?

asr-002299
03:39:49.020 --> 03:40:01.060
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Kung aabot sa Commission en banc level, mag-inhibit si Commissioner Lipana.

asr-002300
03:40:01.060 --> 03:40:10.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Okay, Mr. Speaker, yun po ang pangunahing concern natin.

asr-002301
03:40:10.900 --> 03:40:12.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Marami pong mga…

asr-002302
03:40:13.340 --> 03:40:20.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nakatutok sa Commission on Appointments ngayon at ang pagtingin nga ay may cloud.

asr-002303
03:40:22.300 --> 03:40:40.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong question sa credibility ng Commission dahil ang isa sa kanilang, isa sa tatlong Commissioner ay, yun nga, asawa ng isang contractor na sabi na rin ng COA na issuean pa ng notice of disallowance

asr-002304
03:40:40.700 --> 03:40:46.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kaugnay sa flood control or DPWH contracts, no?

asr-002305
03:40:46.420 --> 03:41:10.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, kaya po, sinikap nating linawin ano ba talaga ang status nitong si Commissioner Lipana at ngayon malinaw na nagpapatuloy pa rin siya sa kanyang panunungkulan panapanahong nag-a-avail ng sick leave at, well,

asr-002306
03:41:10.380 --> 03:41:19.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: merong pahayag dito na kung sakaling may conflict of interest, magkakaroon ng conflict of interest, mag-inhibit ang Commissioner.

asr-002307
03:41:19.980 --> 03:41:24.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hanggang doon na lang po siguro muna, Mr. Speaker. Maraming salamat po, ginuong sponsor.

asr-002308
03:41:25.620 --> 03:41:28.740
Rep. John Tracy F. Cagas: Thank you, Representative. Salamat po.

