Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ilang machine ang na-deploy? Ilan ang hindi nag-start? Ilan ang nag-malfunction habang bumoboto ang publiko?

asr-002811
04:05:22.000 --> 04:05:27.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ilan ang na-repair? Ilan ang kinakailangang palitan? Ilan ang hindi nakapag-transmit electronically?

asr-002812
04:05:28.380 --> 04:05:35.740
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ilan ang kinakailangang gumamit ng alternative transmission? Gano'ng katagal ang average waiting time para sa replacement?

asr-002813
04:05:35.860 --> 04:05:46.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ilang election protests ang direktang naugnay sa machine counting errors? Anong defects ang hindi kayang ayusin sa pamagitan ng ordinary repair or upgrade?

asr-002814
04:05:46.800 --> 04:05:54.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi ko lang po hinihingi na sagutin ito ngayon. Hinihingi ko lang po na maibigay sa atin yung mga sagot na ito sa lalong madaling panahon.

asr-002815
04:05:54.920 --> 04:06:03.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Mr. Speaker. The Commission will comply. Ia-add lang rin po nila yung reports during the BARM elections rin po para po makonsolidate yung data.

asr-002816
04:06:04.580 --> 04:06:04.920
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Regarding doon sa...

asr-002817
04:06:05.860 --> 04:06:17.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Lilinawin ko rin po ulit. Hindi po nagrekomenda ang Comelec Advisory Council na ang gamitin natin for the 2025 elections ay brand new machines.

asr-002818
04:06:18.520 --> 04:06:24.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi po, Mr. Speaker. More on technical issues lang po yung kanilang po narekomenda.

asr-002819
04:06:28.680 --> 04:06:32.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nag-recommend ba ang Advisory Council laban sa reuse?

asr-002820
04:06:35.860 --> 04:06:37.720
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi po, Mr. Speaker.

asr-002821
04:06:38.800 --> 04:06:49.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Paano po nailagay yung brand new doon sa Terms of Reference? Hindi ba inuunahan ng Comelec ang isang technical question na ipinagkatiwala ng Batas Advisory Council?

asr-002822
04:06:50.740 --> 04:07:01.660
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi naman po kasi, Mr. Speaker, finafinalize pa rin naman po yung TOR. Any suggestion coming from our colleagues and other partners po, welcome na welcome naman po.

asr-002823
04:07:02.020 --> 04:07:05.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: But it was not discussed in the meeting.

asr-002824
04:07:05.860 --> 04:07:20.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: It was not discussed in the meeting of the Comelec Advisory Council whether... Kasi po, napaka-critical nung reuse because it can save 8 to 10 billion pesos. Bakit hindi ito napag-usapan sa Comelec Advisory Council?

asr-002825
04:07:21.360 --> 04:07:29.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Well, Mr. Speaker, more importantly, hindi po kasi parte ang Comelec ng Comelec Advisory Council. So, kaya hindi po siya napag-usap.

asr-002826
04:07:29.980 --> 04:07:32.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ay, wala pong say ang ating komisyon.

asr-002827
04:07:32.900 --> 04:07:33.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: kung ano po yung

asr-002828
04:07:33.980 --> 04:07:36.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: rekomendasyon po ng ating CAC.

asr-002829
04:07:37.600 --> 04:07:45.420
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yung pagtatali po sa brand new hindi naman po nila minamandato.

asr-002830
04:07:46.160 --> 04:08:02.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero, dahil po medyo rapid po yung changing technologies po ngayon, yun po yung naiisip o nai-envision po ng ating komisyon na gamitin para po mas sigurado dahil nga po may mga certain issues po ng overheating na na...

asr-002831
04:08:03.980 --> 04:08:05.820
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ...experience po ng ating 2025 election.

asr-002832
04:08:07.280 --> 04:08:18.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ibig pong sabihin, sa napakahalagang issue ng reuse, ay hindi po pinag-usapan ng Comelec Advisory Council ito?

asr-002833
04:08:20.500 --> 04:08:30.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Hindi po napag-usapan ng ating CAC ang ating kanyang rekomendasyon po, Mr. Speaker, kasi hindi po talaga parte ang Comelec ng CAC.

asr-002834
04:08:33.980 --> 04:08:47.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, ibig pong sabihin, binibigyan ng CAC ang Comelec ng Blanket Authority dating po sa issue ng reuse. Tama po ba yan?

asr-002835
04:08:53.860 --> 04:09:03.860
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, Mr. Speaker, hindi naman po Blanket Authority. Ang ating komisyon ay lagi pong kinukonsidera ang rekomendasyon po ng ating...

asr-002836
04:09:03.980 --> 04:09:08.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: ...Comelec Advisory Council at ang iba pong partners.

asr-002837
04:09:08.800 --> 04:09:15.060
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sabalit, ito po ay isa sa pinakamahalagang technical issue, whether reuse is possible.

asr-002838
04:09:16.340 --> 04:09:17.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit hindi pinag-usapan?

asr-002839
04:09:19.040 --> 04:09:32.980
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ito po ba ay, ano, kailangan pang ang inyong lingkod ang magpaalam sa Comelec Advisory Council para hihingin ang kanilang opinion pagdating po sa issue ng reuse?

asr-002840
04:09:33.980 --> 04:09:47.700
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, hindi po silang pwedeng, ang ating komisyon, hindi po pong pwedeng mga alam kung ano po yung napag-uusapan doon.

asr-002841
04:09:48.140 --> 04:09:55.260
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Pero yung ating pong question on reuse, open naman po ang ating pong komisyon, pag-aaralan po nila.

asr-002842
04:09:55.260 --> 04:10:00.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hayaan niyo po at tutulungan natin ang Comelec na tanungin ang Comelec Advisory Council.

asr-002843
04:10:01.440 --> 04:10:03.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nasa ilalim po ng Republic Act No.

asr-002844
04:10:03.980 --> 04:10:11.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: 12009, the New Government Procurement Act, kinakailangan ng value for money, market scoping at lifestyle cost analysis.

asr-002845
04:10:12.080 --> 04:10:19.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nagsagawa ba ang Comelec ng cost analysis bago nito iminungkahi ang 23 billion halaga?

asr-002846
04:10:21.300 --> 04:10:25.980
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes po, Mr. Speaker, nagkasagawa po ng market scoping ating pong Comelec.

asr-002847
04:10:26.940 --> 04:10:32.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At pwede niyo po bang i-discuss ito ngayon kung ano yung mga findings?

asr-002848
04:10:33.980 --> 04:10:37.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Please, on how did you arrive with 23 billion?

asr-002849
04:10:43.300 --> 04:10:53.340
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang base po sa kanilang market scoping, ang presyo po na kailangan niya ay 25.6 billion.

asr-002850
04:10:56.500 --> 04:10:57.900
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lease pa lang po ito.

asr-002851
04:10:58.780 --> 04:10:59.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pardon?

asr-002852
04:10:59.460 --> 04:11:02.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lease pa lang po, contract of lease, renta po.

asr-002853
04:11:03.980 --> 04:11:04.640
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker.

asr-002854
04:11:05.200 --> 04:11:09.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Meaning, magkano po per unit?

asr-002855
04:11:17.580 --> 04:11:26.760
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Ang estimate price po niya, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, mga 180,000 per machine po.

asr-002856
04:11:28.040 --> 04:11:33.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nagsagawa po ba ang Comelec ng consultation regarding sa mga posibilidad?

asr-002857
04:11:33.980 --> 04:11:42.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Halaga ng reuse, halaga ng reuse ng 2025 machines, halaga ng upgrading, halaga ng pag-lease lamang ng karagdagang machines,

asr-002858
04:11:42.820 --> 04:11:48.580
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: halaga ng isang completely new system at expected useful life at residual value ng bawat opso.

asr-002859
04:11:53.580 --> 04:12:00.800
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, sa ngayon wala pa po na nagagawa on the study regarding sa reuse po.

asr-002860
04:12:00.800 --> 04:12:11.780
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: So, habang pina-finalize pa po yung ating TOR, wala pa pong final say ang ating pong Comelec regarding that matter.

asr-002861
04:12:12.020 --> 04:12:17.600
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: And, iniintay rin pong matapos rin po yung final counting nung sa Bangsamoro.

asr-002862
04:12:19.600 --> 04:12:26.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nagtataka lang po ako, Mr. Speaker, na we arrive at 23 billion without doing all these matters.

asr-002863
04:12:26.760 --> 04:12:28.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Bakit hindi mo natin ginawa ito?

asr-002864
04:12:28.380 --> 04:12:29.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, upang na...

asr-002865
04:12:30.800 --> 04:12:40.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Pagkaharap sa budget, dito po, pag-ingin ng budget sa ating bayan, alam natin kung ano yung cost effective.

asr-002866
04:12:40.780 --> 04:12:41.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ngayon po, hindi natin alam kasi.

asr-002867
04:12:42.660 --> 04:12:48.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi natin alam kung gagamitin natin yung dating machine kung kano ba ang magagasos natin.

asr-002868
04:12:49.600 --> 04:12:59.680
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Gaya nga ng sinabi ko kanina, logically, mas mura yung magamit na natin.

asr-002869
04:12:59.800 --> 04:13:00.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung po pwede ba?

asr-002870
04:13:00.400 --> 04:13:03.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sapagkat nandito na yung mga machines. Wala na yung logistics cost.

asr-002871
04:13:08.200 --> 04:13:20.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, ngayon po, kung tatanungin ko kayo, hindi nyo po masasagot kung magkano yung repurbish cost at upgrading cost nung Miro machine kung ito ang gagamitin natin.

asr-002872
04:13:25.780 --> 04:13:27.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At least estimated po sa...

asr-002873
04:13:27.540 --> 04:13:29.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Alam ko naman na pakita sa bidding.

asr-002874
04:13:29.680 --> 04:13:30.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Saka mo malalaman.

asr-002875
04:13:30.400 --> 04:13:37.940
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Alam ko naman kung ano yung cost. Pero yung estimated cost ng reuse compared to a brand new machine.

asr-002876
04:13:40.440 --> 04:13:55.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, as of now po, hindi pa po napafactor in yung presyo ng ating pag-referbish ng mga nagamit na dahil hindi pa nga po final yung TOR.

asr-002877
04:13:55.940 --> 04:13:57.940
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Tapos...

asr-002879
04:14:00.400 --> 04:14:07.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: What does it mean that the Commission on Elections is hell-bent on leasing a brand new machine?

asr-002880
04:14:07.960 --> 04:14:15.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Because they did not factor in existence of these old machines.

asr-002881
04:14:15.720 --> 04:14:21.300
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, hindi naman po sila hell-bent to lease new machines.

asr-002882
04:14:22.420 --> 04:14:29.300
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: They will study kung ano po yung pangailangan pa kung magre-reuse po ng ating mga machines na nagamit po ng...

asr-002883
04:14:30.400 --> 04:14:33.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: May 2025 National and Local Elections pati ng BARB.

asr-002884
04:14:35.240 --> 04:14:44.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Ano po bang particular na requirement ng 2028 ang hindi kayang gawin ng 2025 machines?

asr-002886
04:15:00.000 --> 04:15:27.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, more on additional machines po, yung kakailanganin din, kailangan po mag-input ng ibang measures para po yung mga issues na experienced po noong 2025 elections, pati nitong BARM, iayos na rin po, ma-incorporate po sa ating mga machines na i-release, if ever, Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague.

asr-002887
04:15:27.060 --> 04:15:36.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: I have several questions here. Hindi ko na po inihiling na sagutin nyo na rin kagad ngayon. Maaari lang po maibigay sa akin ng kasagutan sa lalong magdaling panahon.

asr-002888
04:15:37.080 --> 04:15:39.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kaya ba nilang mag-scan ng mas mahabang balot?

asr-002889
04:15:40.920 --> 04:15:47.560
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Maaari bang i-reconfigure ang software para sa President at Vice President nitong mga lumang machine?

asr-002890
04:15:48.120 --> 04:15:51.140
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Maaari bang i-upgrade ang memory, modem, batteries, o processors?

asr-002891
04:15:51.140 --> 04:15:56.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung mas marami ang precincts, bakit hindi na lamang mag-lease o kumuha ng karagdagang machines?

asr-002892
04:15:57.060 --> 04:16:00.960
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kaysa halip na palitan ng 110,620 machines.

asr-002893
04:16:02.400 --> 04:16:13.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kailangan siguro po ay i-quantify talaga ng COMELEC yung additional workload, tukuyin ang eksaktong hardware limitation bago tayo mag-desisyon.

asr-002894
04:16:14.180 --> 04:16:25.600
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kung walang malinaw na sagot, ang mas complex na presidential election ay slogan lamang, hindi bidding, sapagkat nakita ko po maraming mga violations.

asr-002895
04:16:25.980 --> 04:16:26.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: In fact,

asr-002896
04:16:27.060 --> 04:16:42.280
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: One of my allegations was gumamit lang yung Miro ng isang kumpanya para maabot yung kanyang contracting capacity.

asr-002897
04:16:42.580 --> 04:16:45.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At yung kumpanya po na yan ay yung mga nakakulong na ngayon.

asr-002898
04:16:46.000 --> 04:16:47.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro po, alam nyo.

asr-002899
04:16:47.400 --> 04:16:57.020
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: So, mahalaga po na maging malinaw in terms of reference natin para hindi masisentro baka mangyari yan isang bidder na naman.

asr-002900
04:16:57.060 --> 04:17:05.700
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Baka yung terms of reference ay tailored fit sa isang bidder.

asr-002901
04:17:05.840 --> 04:17:11.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Siguro po, sa akin naman po, it's more of a caution rather than an accusation.

asr-002902
04:17:11.840 --> 04:17:21.680
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mas mabuti ngayon pa lang, mas malinaw na kaysa dubating doon sa punto na kinakailangan na naman ang inyong lingkod ay mag-file ng kaso sa Korte Suprema.

asr-002903
04:17:21.860 --> 04:17:24.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Mas mabuti pa ngayon pa lang, maisaayos na.

asr-002904
04:17:26.180 --> 04:17:27.000
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker,

asr-002905
04:17:27.060 --> 04:17:32.460
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Tama po yung ating kasamahan po dito sa Kongreso.

asr-002906
04:17:32.820 --> 04:17:41.540
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: The Commission will take into account lahat po ng suggestion at yung mga hinihingi pong mga kasagutan regarding po sa technical specification po.

asr-002907
04:17:42.020 --> 04:17:50.240
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Lalo na po doon sa machines na ginawit po ng last national and local elections, sasabit po ng ating komisyon.

asr-002908
04:17:50.680 --> 04:17:55.300
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Finally, Mr. Speaker, distinguished sponsor,

asr-002909
04:17:55.640 --> 04:17:57.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: meron po akong ilang mga kasusunod.

asr-002910
04:17:57.060 --> 04:18:09.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May mga katanungan na nais ko din masagot ng Commission on Elections upang masiguro natin na magiging mas maayos ang procurement natin for the 2028 elections.

asr-002911
04:18:09.740 --> 04:18:22.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Unang tanong, siguro po kailangan sagutin ng malinaw, may independent study ba na nagsasabing safe o unsafe yung 2025 machines na ginamit natin?

asr-002912
04:18:24.340 --> 04:18:26.340
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: May independent study ba?

asr-002913
04:18:27.060 --> 04:18:30.400
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: technically obsolete

asr-002914
04:18:30.400 --> 04:18:31.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: o hindi pa ang mga ito?

asr-002915
04:18:32.940 --> 04:18:34.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Natukoy na ba ng Comelec

asr-002916
04:18:34.220 --> 04:18:36.360
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang remaining useful life ng machines?

asr-002917
04:18:38.140 --> 04:18:40.040
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Congressman Erice, your time is up.

asr-002918
04:18:40.320 --> 04:18:41.260
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Kindly wind up, please.

asr-002919
04:18:41.260 --> 04:18:44.080
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes, I'm winding up. This is my final...

asr-002920
04:18:44.080 --> 04:18:44.520
Deputy Speaker Vincent Franco "Duke" D. Frasco: Thank you.

asr-002921
04:18:46.260 --> 04:18:47.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Natukoy na ba ang halaga ng

asr-002922
04:18:47.640 --> 04:18:50.100
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: refurbishment and upgrading nito?

asr-002923
04:18:50.100 --> 04:18:51.660
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: At kung magkano?

asr-002924
04:18:52.280 --> 04:18:53.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nakumpleto na ba ang

asr-002925
04:18:53.220 --> 04:18:55.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: life cycle cost comparison?

asr-002926
04:18:55.920 --> 04:18:57.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yes or no?

asr-002927
04:18:57.680 --> 04:18:58.640
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Nag-recommend ba?

asr-002928
04:18:59.340 --> 04:19:01.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Kailangan siguro po na muling konsultuhin

asr-002929
04:19:01.800 --> 04:19:04.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang advisory council tungkol dito.

asr-002930
04:19:06.700 --> 04:19:08.160
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sinumite ba ng Comelec

asr-002931
04:19:08.160 --> 04:19:09.920
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: sa Kongreso ang resolution

asr-002932
04:19:09.920 --> 04:19:11.540
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: minutes at technical studies?

asr-002933
04:19:12.740 --> 04:19:14.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Papayagan ba ng terms of reference

asr-002934
04:19:14.520 --> 04:19:16.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang qualified bidder na mag-aalok

asr-002935
04:19:16.180 --> 04:19:18.320
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng proven, secure, and upgraded machines?

asr-002936
04:19:19.440 --> 04:19:20.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Sumasangayon ba

asr-002937
04:19:20.260 --> 04:19:22.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ang Comelec na walang final decision

asr-002938
04:19:22.120 --> 04:19:24.180
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: hanggat hindi nakakatanggap ang Kongreso

asr-002939
04:19:24.180 --> 04:19:25.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng independent,

asr-002940
04:19:25.380 --> 04:19:27.460
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: itemized, at auditable

asr-002941
04:19:27.460 --> 04:19:29.480
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: comparison ng lahat

asr-002942
04:19:29.480 --> 04:19:30.760
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ng options?

asr-002943
04:19:31.300 --> 04:19:33.260
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Yun lamang po at hinihingi ko

asr-002944
04:19:33.260 --> 04:19:35.000
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: na masagot ito ng

asr-002945
04:19:35.000 --> 04:19:36.520
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Commission on Elections. Salamat po.

asr-002946
04:19:36.900 --> 04:19:38.960
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Yes, Mr. Speaker. The Commission will

asr-002947
04:19:38.960 --> 04:19:41.060
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: submit po

asr-002948
04:19:41.060 --> 04:19:42.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung lahat po ng katanungan po ng ating

asr-002949
04:19:42.680 --> 04:19:45.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: distinguished colleague. As regards po

asr-002950
04:19:45.020 --> 04:19:47.040
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: sa independent study, hinihintay lang rin po

asr-002951
04:19:47.040 --> 04:19:48.740
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: yung katapusan po ng ating

asr-002952
04:19:48.740 --> 04:19:49.440
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Bangsamoro

