asr-003072
04:26:54.240 --> 04:27:06.020
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague, kulang po yung naibigay na budget para po sa ating Comelec regarding voters education with regard sa online voting po.

asr-003073
