asr-003094
04:30:13.480 --> 04:30:24.680
Rep. Keith Micah "Atty. Mike" D.L. Tan: Mr. Speaker, Distinguished Colleague, yung regarding po, specifically yung sa Maluso, Basilan, nagkaroon po ng pre-shading po ng ballots.

asr-003095
