06:05:54.860 --> 06:05:56.060
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: But freezing an asset,

asr-004639
06:05:56.060 --> 06:05:59.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: is not the same as recovering the asset.

asr-004640
06:05:59.540 --> 06:06:00.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Am I right?

asr-004641
06:06:00.580 --> 06:06:02.780
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Yes, Mr. Speaker, correct.

asr-004642
06:06:02.780 --> 06:06:05.020
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Of the assets frozen

asr-004643
06:06:05.020 --> 06:06:06.700
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in corruption-related cases,

asr-004644
06:06:06.700 --> 06:06:08.980
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: how much has actually reached final

asr-004645
06:06:08.980 --> 06:06:12.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: forfeiture in favor of the government?

asr-004646
06:06:12.900 --> 06:06:16.380
