asr-004680
06:07:54.900 --> 06:07:59.220
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I think one measure of AMLOC effectiveness

asr-004681
06:07:59.220 --> 06:08:02.460
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: in the number of criminal networks first identified

asr-004682
06:08:02.460 --> 06:08:04.540
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: through its own financial intelligence

asr-004683
06:08:04.540 --> 06:08:06.780
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: instead of just being reactive.

asr-004684
06:08:06.780 --> 06:08:11.580
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Would you agree with that, Madam Sponsor?

asr-004685
06:08:11.580 --> 06:08:14.060
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004686
06:08:14.060 --> 06:08:17.900
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is an important distinction, Mr. Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-004687
06:08:17.900 --> 06:08:22.180
