asr-004701
06:09:13.420 --> 06:09:18.820
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: cases in which the AMLOC itself identified suspicious activity

asr-004702
06:09:18.820 --> 06:09:24.220
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: and referred it to law enforcement or foreign counterparts without a prior request.

asr-004703
06:09:24.220 --> 06:09:26.900
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: The limiting factor is capacity.

asr-004704
06:09:26.900 --> 06:09:37.100
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Suspicious transaction reports received rose from 10.9 million in 2023 to 62.9 million in 2025.

asr-004705
06:09:37.100 --> 06:09:40.020
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: In the flood control investigation alone,

asr-004706
06:09:40.020 --> 06:09:44.980
