asr-004707
06:09:44.980 --> 06:09:50.580
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: and 492,346 covered transaction reports

asr-004708
06:09:50.580 --> 06:09:52.580
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: to produce 52 financial intelligence products,

asr-004712
06:09:54.940 --> 06:09:57.900
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: on 393 persons of interest.

asr-004713
06:09:57.900 --> 06:10:05.580
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Scaling that kind of analysis is what the 2027 budget is for.

asr-004714
