Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleagues, magandang gabi. It is a privilege of this representation to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the National

asr-004823
06:20:30.000 --> 06:20:38.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Intelligence Coordinating Agency. We are now ready to answer questions regarding the budget. Thank you.

asr-004823-split-2
