asr-004824-split-3
06:21:11.200 --> 06:21:30.960
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. There being no more members of the minority who wish to interpellate, I move to terminate the period of sponsorship debate for the budget of the National Intelligence Coordinating

asr-004825
06:21:30.960 --> 06:21:34.200
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Agency. I so move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004825-split-2
06:21:34.200 --> 06:21:43.000
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: What does the House say?

asr-004825-split-3
06:21:43.000 --> 06:21:53.720
Rep. Esmael G. Mangudadatu: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpellations on the proposed budget of the National Intelligence Coordinating Agency.

asr-004825-split-4
06:21:53.720 --> 06:22:00.000
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellations on the proposed budget of the National Intelligence Coordinating Agency.

asr-004826
06:22:00.000 --> 06:22:24.520
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Is there any objection? There is none. Motion is approved. The interpellation of the proposed budget of the National Intelligence Coordinating Agency is terminated. Majority Leader.

asr-004826-split-2
06:22:24.520 --> 06:22:26.080
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move to suspend the session for a

asr-004827
06:22:26.080 --> 06:22:26.878
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: few minutes.

asr-004827-split-2
06:22:26.878 --> 06:22:27.500
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Session suspended.

asr-004836
06:25:04.400 --> 06:25:06.360
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Session resumed.

asr-004837
06:25:06.360 --> 06:25:07.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-004838
06:25:07.880 --> 06:25:12.000
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move to consider the proposed budget of the National Security Council.

asr-004839
06:25:12.000 --> 06:25:16.560
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a motion to consider the budget of the National Security Council.

asr-004840
06:25:16.560 --> 06:25:18.400
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Is there any objection? There is none.

asr-004841
06:25:18.400 --> 06:25:21.200
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Motion is carried. Majority Leader.

asr-004842
06:25:21.200 --> 06:25:24.080
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials

asr-004843
06:25:24.080 --> 06:25:26.840
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: of the National Security Council, namely

asr-004844
06:25:26.840 --> 06:25:33.160
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: National Security Advisor and Director General Eduardo SL Oban Jr.

asr-004861
06:25:33.160 --> 06:25:48.880
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Deputy Director General and Chief of Staff Benjamin Madrigal Jr., Deputy Director General Pedro S. Soria II, Deputy Director General Nestor Herico, Assistant Director General Francisco F. Mendoza Jr.,

asr-004862
06:25:48.880 --> 06:26:00.440
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Officer in Charge, Assistant Director General Maria Lourdes V. Santelises, and Executive Director Danilo Pamonag. I so move, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004863
06:26:00.440 --> 06:26:08.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Maayong gabi. In behalf of our Speaker Bod and Majority Leader Sandro Marcos, we acknowledge the presence

asr-004864
06:26:08.880 --> 06:26:18.280
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: and heads of the National Security Council, National Security Advisor and Director General Eduardo Oban Jr.,

asr-004865
06:26:18.280 --> 06:26:26.760
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: our former commanding officer, Deputy Director General and Chief of Staff General Madrigal,

asr-004866
06:26:26.760 --> 06:26:29.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Deputy Director General Pedro Soria,

asr-004867
06:26:29.160 --> 06:26:35.200
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Deputy Director General Nestor Herico, Assistant Director General Francisco Mendoza,

asr-004868
06:26:35.200 --> 06:26:41.260
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Official in Charge Assistant Director General Maria Lourdes Santelises, and Executive Director Danilo Pamonag.

asr-004869
06:26:41.260 --> 06:26:43.940
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Welcome to the House of Representatives. Majority Leader.

asr-004870
06:26:45.260 --> 06:26:48.440
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we open the period of sponsorship and debate.

asr-004871
06:26:54.680 --> 06:26:57.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There's a motion to open the period of sponsorship and debate.

asr-004872
06:26:57.900 --> 06:27:00.708
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Is there any objection? Chair hears none. Motion is carried.

asr-004873
06:27:00.718 --> 06:27:09.140
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Vice Chair Bella Vanessa Suansing from the 2nd District of Sultan Kudarat

asr-004874
06:27:09.140 --> 06:27:16.430
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: on the Committee of Appropriations to sponsor the proposed budget of the National Security Council.

asr-004875
06:27:16.440 --> 06:27:24.750
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentle lady from the 2nd District from Sultan Kudarat, Honorable Vice Chair Bella Vanessa, ma'am, you are recognized.

asr-004876
06:27:24.760 --> 06:27:27.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Mr. Speaker. Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleagues,

asr-004877
06:27:27.900 --> 06:27:36.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: good evening. It is a privilege of this representation to sponsor the proposed fiscal year 2027 budget of the National Security Council.

asr-004878
06:27:37.360 --> 06:27:41.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: We are now ready to answer questions regarding this proposed budget. Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004879
06:27:42.040 --> 06:27:43.980
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much. Majority Leader.

asr-004880
06:27:45.560 --> 06:27:54.800
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize the Honorable Representative of Kabataan Partylist Representative Rene Luis M. Co.

asr-004881
06:27:54.800 --> 06:27:59.080
Rep. Patrick Michael D. Vargas: to interpolate on the proposed budget of the National Security Council.

asr-004882
06:27:59.080 --> 06:28:08.280
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentle lady from Kabataan Partylist Representative Rene Luis M. Co. is recognized. Ma'am, you have the floor.

asr-004883
06:28:08.280 --> 06:28:12.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, and good evening to our distinguished sponsor.

asr-004884
06:28:13.460 --> 06:28:22.720
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, may the sponsor yield to a few questions in relation to the budget of the National Security Council and spending.

asr-004885
06:28:23.520 --> 06:28:25.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, gladly, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004886
06:28:25.360 --> 06:28:27.400
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor to refresh.

asr-004887
06:28:27.900 --> 06:28:31.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The August Chamber, what is the budget of the National Security Council?

asr-004888
06:28:33.380 --> 06:28:41.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The fiscal year 2027 budget of the National Security Council proposed amount is 1.136 billion pesos.

asr-004889
06:28:42.280 --> 06:28:47.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This is lower than the fiscal year 2026 level.

asr-004890
06:28:49.420 --> 06:28:54.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Should we look through the details of the breakdown, Mr. Speaker?

asr-004891
06:28:55.360 --> 06:28:57.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We'd like to receive that as well, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004892
06:28:57.900 --> 06:28:58.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good sponsor.

asr-004893
06:28:58.880 --> 06:29:02.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: What of its MOOE, Mr. Speaker?

asr-004894
06:29:02.280 --> 06:29:02.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good sponsor.

asr-004895
06:29:03.660 --> 06:29:13.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, the MOOE, the proposed 2027 level is 962.568 million pesos, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004896
06:29:13.760 --> 06:29:17.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So most of its budget would be on its MOOE, Mr. Speaker?

asr-004897
06:29:17.740 --> 06:29:18.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Good sponsor.

asr-004898
06:29:19.760 --> 06:29:21.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, that would be correct, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004899
06:29:22.260 --> 06:29:23.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-004900
06:29:24.520 --> 06:29:27.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I'd like to ask specifically.

asr-004901
06:29:27.900 --> 06:29:34.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Specifically, paano ginamit ng National Security Council yung kanyang MOOE?

asr-004902
06:29:35.140 --> 06:29:44.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: We are aware that this year, NSC has released the Philippine Journal on National Security.

asr-004903
06:29:45.380 --> 06:29:47.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Supposedly, this is its first edition.

asr-004904
06:29:48.220 --> 06:29:49.740
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Supposedly, this is volume one.

asr-004905
06:29:50.260 --> 06:29:54.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, may I request information?

asr-004906
06:29:54.000 --> 06:29:55.860
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Magkano po ang ginasta?

asr-004907
06:29:56.780 --> 06:29:57.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Para?

asr-004908
06:29:57.900 --> 06:30:00.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mabuo ang Philippine Journal on National Security?

asr-004909
06:30:00.000 --> 06:30:07.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on national security, magkano din ang pinaplano kung meron pong subsequent editions or subsequent volumes nito?

asr-004910
06:30:09.220 --> 06:30:17.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker. With regard to the programs and projects under the MOOE for fiscal year 2026, this?

asr-004911
06:30:18.780 --> 06:30:20.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2027, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004912
06:30:20.160 --> 06:30:21.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Ah, for 2027.

asr-004914
06:31:04.240 --> 06:31:20.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: While the agency is pulling up the data, Mr. Speaker, a significant portion of it would be for the implementation of the National Strategic Plan and the National Security Strategy.

asr-004915
06:31:20.820 --> 06:31:29.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: These would also be allocated towards strategic engagements at the bilateral, trilateral, and multilateral levels.

asr-004916
06:31:30.000 --> 06:31:40.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As well as the monitoring of the NSP and NSS implementations and systems improvement on the administrative side of the NSC.

asr-004917
06:31:40.800 --> 06:31:41.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker.

asr-004918
06:31:41.720 --> 06:31:50.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, we'd like to request details on how much was spent on the Philippine National Security Journal.

asr-004924
06:32:59.320 --> 06:33:04.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, colleague, as for the NSC?

asr-004925
06:33:18.880 --> 06:33:24.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With regard to the printing and publication expenses?

asr-004926
06:33:24.000 --> 06:33:24.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-004927
06:33:35.840 --> 06:33:48.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This is just for all publications, the printing and publication expenses for 2020.

asr-004928
06:33:48.000 --> 06:33:50.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's 2.1 billion.

asr-004929
06:33:52.000 --> 06:33:54.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: 2.1 billion, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor?

asr-004930
06:33:54.840 --> 06:33:55.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Million.

asr-004931
06:33:55.840 --> 06:33:58.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 2.1 million, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004932
06:33:58.020 --> 06:33:59.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: For all publication expenses.

asr-004933
06:34:00.000 --> 06:34:00.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-004934
06:34:00.580 --> 06:34:02.280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And not specifically this journal only.

asr-004935
06:34:02.500 --> 06:34:03.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker.

asr-004936
06:34:04.040 --> 06:34:08.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, we'd also like to request a breakdown of that data once available.

asr-004937
06:34:09.280 --> 06:34:13.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: If this week is doable, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-004938
06:34:15.380 --> 06:34:17.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the agency will comply.

asr-004939
06:34:18.500 --> 06:34:27.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, we'd like to take a moment to check the contents, the validity,

asr-004940
06:34:27.540 --> 06:34:29.540
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and even to…

asr-004941
06:34:30.000 --> 06:34:40.080
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: To scrutinize whether the budget going to the publication of this journal is indeed

asr-004942
06:34:40.080 --> 06:34:45.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: money well spent for the public, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor.

asr-004943
06:34:45.680 --> 06:34:53.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: First of all, we'd like to note that in the foreword of this journal, it is the maiden

asr-004944
06:34:53.160 --> 06:34:58.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: issue that states that it is vital in advancing scholarly inquiry.

asr-004945
06:34:58.940 --> 06:35:02.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Especially to inform policy discourse.

asr-004946
06:35:02.020 --> 06:35:09.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And to clarify, this maiden issue of the Philippine Journal on National Security is entitled,

asr-004947
06:35:09.020 --> 06:35:15.020
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Target to Threat, the Psychology and Prevention of Terror Grooming.

asr-004948
06:35:15.020 --> 06:35:27.320
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Where here it says, and in the first page of the journal, that there is a vulnerable stage where young minds,

asr-004949
06:35:27.320 --> 06:35:28.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: shaped by curiosity,

asr-004950
06:35:28.940 --> 06:35:30.060
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and uncertainty,

asr-004951
06:35:30.720 --> 06:35:33.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: become potential targets of manipulation

asr-004952
06:35:33.000 --> 06:35:34.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and radical influence.

asr-004953
06:35:36.320 --> 06:35:37.640
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: It highlights that terror grooming

asr-004954
06:35:37.640 --> 06:35:38.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: can begin in familiar environments

asr-004955
06:35:39.520 --> 06:35:40.680
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: such as schools,

asr-004956
06:35:41.040 --> 06:35:43.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: where ideologies can quietly take root.

asr-004957
06:35:44.040 --> 06:35:45.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, apparently, this issue

asr-004958
06:35:45.440 --> 06:35:46.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: would like to advance

asr-004959
06:35:47.460 --> 06:35:48.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: scholarly inquiry

asr-004960
06:35:48.760 --> 06:35:50.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: on terror tagging

asr-004961
06:35:50.560 --> 06:35:53.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and how vulnerable young minds

asr-004962
06:35:53.220 --> 06:35:54.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: are in schools

asr-004963
06:35:54.140 --> 06:35:57.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: for what it describes

asr-004964
06:35:57.580 --> 06:35:58.220
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: to be

asr-004965
06:35:58.940 --> 06:36:04.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: manipulation and radical influence.

asr-004966
06:36:05.800 --> 06:36:07.800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Yet, how can the journal

asr-004967
06:36:07.800 --> 06:36:10.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and agency advance scholarly inquiry

asr-004968
06:36:10.820 --> 06:36:12.780
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: when, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-004969
06:36:13.360 --> 06:36:15.180
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: one, nowhere in the journal

asr-004970
06:36:15.180 --> 06:36:17.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: does it state that it has

asr-004971
06:36:17.040 --> 06:36:19.000
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: gone through peer review policy

asr-004972
06:36:19.000 --> 06:36:21.500
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and has no reviewer list

asr-004973
06:36:21.500 --> 06:36:23.560
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: when the editorial board

asr-004974
06:36:23.560 --> 06:36:24.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is composed entirely

asr-004975
06:36:24.760 --> 06:36:26.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of NSC officials by rank,

asr-004976
06:36:26.820 --> 06:36:28.820
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: not independent academic experts.

asr-004977
06:36:28.940 --> 06:36:30.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And the editor-in-chief

asr-004978
06:36:30.940 --> 06:36:32.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is also a contributing author

asr-004979
06:36:32.940 --> 06:36:34.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of two pieces.

asr-004980
06:36:34.940 --> 06:36:36.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: The editor's note and an article

asr-004981
06:36:36.940 --> 06:36:38.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: which, to this representation,

asr-004982
06:36:38.940 --> 06:36:40.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: is a display

asr-004983
06:36:40.940 --> 06:36:42.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of conflict of interest.

asr-004984
06:36:42.940 --> 06:36:44.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-004985
06:36:44.940 --> 06:36:46.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: what is the plan

asr-004986
06:36:46.940 --> 06:36:48.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of NSC when it said that this

asr-004987
06:36:48.940 --> 06:36:50.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: journal will advance

asr-004988
06:36:50.940 --> 06:36:52.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: scholarly inquiry

asr-004989
06:36:52.940 --> 06:36:54.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: when it suffers through

asr-004990
06:36:54.940 --> 06:36:56.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: these limitations

asr-004991
06:36:56.940 --> 06:36:58.940
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of the journal?

asr-005023
06:39:23.480 --> 06:39:27.920
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, if it would be possible that our time would be paused

asr-005024
06:39:27.940 --> 06:39:29.580
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: While the sponsor

asr-005025
06:39:29.580 --> 06:39:30.960
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: confers with the agency.

asr-005027
06:40:36.560 --> 06:41:01.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, as for the NSC, this journal mentioned by our distinguished colleague is actually a compilation of different editorials from different sectors.

asr-005028
06:41:01.120 --> 06:41:27.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This was also produced through the strategic communications cluster of the NTF-ELCAC. We agree that if it were to be deemed a scholarly inquiry, our distinguished colleague is correct that it should be peer reviewed. Claiming that it would be a scholarly inquiry and not

asr-005029
06:41:27.940 --> 06:41:29.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it abiding by the standards of

asr-005030
06:41:30.480 --> 06:41:35.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: academic scholarship is not

asr-005031
06:41:35.680 --> 06:41:37.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it wouldn't be

asr-005032
06:41:37.420 --> 06:41:39.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it shouldn't qualify then as a scholarship

asr-005033
06:41:39.960 --> 06:41:42.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: inquiry, Mr. Speaker.

asr-005034
06:41:42.760 --> 06:41:44.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

