07:12:06.620 --> 07:12:08.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: its bases in the event of a war

asr-005866
07:12:08.820 --> 07:12:10.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: between China and Taiwan.

asr-005867
07:12:11.560 --> 07:12:11.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Quote,

asr-005868
07:12:12.300 --> 07:12:14.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Philippines has no desire to be a

asr-005869
07:12:14.320 --> 07:12:16.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: belligerent nation in the region.

asr-005870
07:12:17.180 --> 07:12:17.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

asr-005871
07:12:20.040 --> 07:12:20.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And,

asr-005872
07:12:20.760 --> 07:12:21.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to quote further,

asr-005873
07:12:23.520 --> 07:12:23.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: no,

asr-005874
07:12:24.480 --> 07:12:26.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there will be no attacks on

asr-005875
07:12:26.560 --> 07:12:28.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: anyone from the Philippines.

asr-005876
07:12:29.020 --> 07:12:30.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We have no interest in that.

asr-005877
07:12:31.800 --> 07:12:32.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Unquote.

asr-005878
07:12:35.060 --> 07:12:36.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: All we are concerned

asr-005879
07:12:36.800 --> 07:12:38.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: about is the defense of our territory

asr-005880
07:12:38.660 --> 07:12:40.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the maintenance of peace and stability

asr-005881
07:12:40.540 --> 07:12:41.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in the region.

asr-005882
07:12:42.400 --> 07:12:44.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That is all that the

asr-005883
07:12:44.780 --> 07:12:46.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Philippines is concerned with. That is

asr-005884
07:12:46.720 --> 07:12:48.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: all the Philippines will promote. That is

asr-005885
07:12:48.820 --> 07:12:50.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: all that the Philippines will endorse

asr-005886
07:12:50.660 --> 07:12:52.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and support.

asr-005887
07:12:53.040 --> 07:12:55.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ayun po. Medyo malinaw po

asr-005888
07:12:55.020 --> 07:12:56.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga pahayag.

asr-005889
07:12:56.560 --> 07:12:58.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na, no attacks

asr-005890
07:12:58.600 --> 07:13:00.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: from the Philippines.

asr-005891
07:13:01.220 --> 07:13:02.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The Philippines will not

asr-005892
07:13:02.740 --> 07:13:05.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: allow any attacks from anyone in the Philippines.

asr-005893
07:13:05.520 --> 07:13:06.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, ang context nito,

asr-005894
07:13:07.600 --> 07:13:08.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kahit nung tinanong, is

asr-005895
07:13:08.900 --> 07:13:10.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the mutual

asr-005896
07:13:10.300 --> 07:13:12.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: defense treaty with the US.

asr-005897
07:13:13.060 --> 07:13:14.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, paano kung na-involve ang

asr-005898
07:13:14.880 --> 07:13:16.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: US sa gera

asr-005899
07:13:16.780 --> 07:13:18.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: laban sa China over Taiwan?

asr-005900
07:13:18.760 --> 07:13:20.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bagay na pinag-ahandaan

asr-005901
07:13:20.600 --> 07:13:22.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng US.

asr-005902
07:13:22.900 --> 07:13:22.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005903
07:13:24.860 --> 07:13:26.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As far as,

asr-005904
07:13:26.560 --> 07:13:27.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the US

asr-005905
07:13:27.660 --> 07:13:30.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: defense policy

asr-005906
07:13:30.820 --> 07:13:31.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: is concerned,

asr-005907
07:13:32.700 --> 07:13:34.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: meron silang tinatawag na Davidson

asr-005908
07:13:34.380 --> 07:13:35.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: window after some

asr-005909
07:13:35.980 --> 07:13:37.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: general

asr-005910
07:13:37.880 --> 07:13:40.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: who claimed

asr-005911
07:13:40.880 --> 07:13:42.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that

asr-005912
07:13:42.580 --> 07:13:45.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2027

asr-005913
07:13:45.060 --> 07:13:46.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: is the target date

asr-005914
07:13:46.600 --> 07:13:48.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of China

asr-005915
07:13:48.320 --> 07:13:50.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: based on Xi Jinping

asr-005916
07:13:50.700 --> 07:13:52.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pronouncement

asr-005917
07:13:52.260 --> 07:13:54.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to be ready for an

asr-005918
07:13:54.860 --> 07:13:56.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: invasion of Taiwan.

asr-005919
07:13:56.560 --> 07:13:58.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: For the forcible

asr-005920
07:13:58.140 --> 07:13:59.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: integration of Taiwan

asr-005921
07:13:59.640 --> 07:14:02.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or unification of Taiwan

asr-005922
07:14:02.000 --> 07:14:04.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: with China. So, meron silang

asr-005923
07:14:04.200 --> 07:14:05.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nominal,

asr-005924
07:14:06.380 --> 07:14:07.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at least as far as the US

asr-005925
07:14:07.880 --> 07:14:09.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: defense establishment is concerned,

asr-005926
07:14:11.020 --> 07:14:12.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yun ang framework nila na

asr-005927
07:14:12.180 --> 07:14:13.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2027,

asr-005928
07:14:13.720 --> 07:14:15.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: China will be prepared

asr-005929
07:14:15.960 --> 07:14:18.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and may actually

asr-005930
07:14:18.220 --> 07:14:22.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: launch an actual

asr-005931
07:14:22.700 --> 07:14:24.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: invasion of

asr-005932
07:14:24.420 --> 07:14:25.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: China. Meron ganon.

asr-005933
07:14:25.760 --> 07:14:26.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005934
07:14:26.560 --> 07:14:30.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, in that event, ano mangyayari sa Pilipinas?

asr-005935
07:14:30.160 --> 07:14:32.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sumasang ayon po ba?

asr-005936
07:14:32.880 --> 07:14:34.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O tama po ba ang

asr-005937
07:14:34.320 --> 07:14:35.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or

asr-005938
07:14:35.020 --> 07:14:38.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: klaro po ang sinabi ng Pangulo?

asr-005939
07:14:38.500 --> 07:14:39.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi, no

asr-005940
07:14:39.220 --> 07:14:41.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: no attacks.

asr-005941
07:14:42.940 --> 07:14:44.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi pwedeng gamitin

asr-005942
07:14:44.080 --> 07:14:44.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang

asr-005943
07:14:44.720 --> 07:14:47.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pilipinas bilang lunsara

asr-005944
07:14:47.980 --> 07:14:48.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng atake

asr-005945
07:14:48.880 --> 07:14:50.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa ibang bansa.

asr-005946
07:14:51.620 --> 07:14:51.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-005947
07:14:52.260 --> 07:14:53.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is that confirmed by

asr-005948
07:14:53.780 --> 07:14:56.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the analysis and standpoint?

asr-005949
07:14:56.560 --> 07:14:58.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the National Security

asr-005950
07:14:58.460 --> 07:14:59.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Council. Ganun nga po ba talaga?

asr-005951
07:15:00.000 --> 07:15:04.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang pagtingin natin na hindi maaaring gamitin ang Pilipinas.

asr-005952
07:15:04.720 --> 07:15:11.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alam natin maraming mga base na binukas ang Pilipinas sa U.S. under EDCA.

asr-005953
07:15:11.920 --> 07:15:16.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Many of them are precisely in the northern Luzon.

asr-005954
07:15:17.420 --> 07:15:20.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dahil nga ang interest ng U.S. ay Taiwan.

asr-005955
07:15:21.280 --> 07:15:24.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So ang pinakamga bagong binuksan dyan, yung sa Lalo Airport,

asr-005956
07:15:24.580 --> 07:15:32.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ano pa ba, sa Isabela, meron din, diba?

asr-005957
07:15:32.700 --> 07:15:33.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Of course, yung Fort Magsaysay.

asr-005958
07:15:34.760 --> 07:15:39.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: These are currently, as well as non-EDCA sites, lalo na yung Batanes,

asr-005959
07:15:40.840 --> 07:15:49.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung U.S. nag-invest para i-upgrade yung mga port facilities in Batanes,

asr-005960
07:15:50.500 --> 07:15:54.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including the northernmost island.

asr-005961
07:15:54.060 --> 07:15:55.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun yatang mabulis.

asr-005962
07:15:56.080 --> 07:16:00.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So yung U.S. naghahanda dyan.

asr-005963
07:16:01.740 --> 07:16:07.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung U.S. military, they regularly hold exercises with the Philippines.

asr-005964
07:16:07.960 --> 07:16:14.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May mga nakabasis silang assets, including Air Force assets na nagpapatrolya.

asr-005965
07:16:15.820 --> 07:16:21.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: From Lalo Airfield to the northern portions of Luzon,

asr-005966
07:16:21.060 --> 07:16:23.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including over the Luzon Strait,

asr-005967
07:16:24.060 --> 07:16:30.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: precisely in preparation for this so-called Taiwan conflict.

asr-005968
07:16:31.740 --> 07:16:41.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ganun nga po ba ang pagtingin ng NSA na hindi maaaring gamitin

asr-005969
07:16:41.920 --> 07:16:51.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang mga basing ito ng U.S. para gawing lunsara ng atake kontra sa China?

asr-005970
07:16:51.200 --> 07:16:52.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tama po ba?

asr-005971
07:16:52.480 --> 07:16:54.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is that consistent with the pronouncement?

asr-005972
07:16:54.040 --> 07:16:54.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Is that consistent with the pronouncement of the President?

asr-005973
07:17:03.780 --> 07:17:06.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the agency agrees with our distinguished colleague.

asr-005974
07:17:07.460 --> 07:17:07.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yes.

asr-005975
07:17:08.420 --> 07:17:09.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O, yun lang. Yun yung sagot.

asr-005976
07:17:10.240 --> 07:17:11.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, then, question.

asr-005977
07:17:12.640 --> 07:17:20.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Isa po sa mga well-known and controversial deployments made by the U.S.

asr-005978
07:17:20.500 --> 07:17:23.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: under the Mutual Defense Treaty,

asr-005979
07:17:23.560 --> 07:17:23.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: EDCA,

asr-005980
07:17:24.240 --> 07:17:24.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and so on,

asr-005981
07:17:25.780 --> 07:17:30.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: is the deployment of the Typhoon missile system.

asr-005982
07:17:31.560 --> 07:17:32.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, meron pong launcher.

asr-005983
07:17:33.720 --> 07:17:34.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung Typhoon launcher.

asr-005984
07:17:34.920 --> 07:17:35.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And in fact,

asr-005985
07:17:36.220 --> 07:17:36.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: initially,

asr-005986
07:17:38.120 --> 07:17:43.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: it is well known that it was deployed

asr-005987
07:17:43.420 --> 07:17:45.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at Balawag Airport.

asr-005988
07:17:46.180 --> 07:17:47.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Itang kita po doon.

asr-005989
07:17:47.740 --> 07:17:52.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nandun yung launcher.

asr-005990
07:17:52.180 --> 07:17:53.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, may complex yan.

asr-005991
07:17:53.940 --> 07:17:58.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Merong mga, mainly, it's a mobile launcher.

asr-005992
07:17:58.620 --> 07:18:01.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: May malaking track, may mahabang trailer.

asr-005993
07:18:01.600 --> 07:18:03.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos nandun yung launcher.

asr-005994
07:18:03.680 --> 07:18:16.040
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And it is also well known that the system is capable of launching the Tomahawk missile,

asr-005995
07:18:16.040 --> 07:18:18.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which is an offensive weapon.

asr-005996
07:18:18.920 --> 07:18:19.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: No?

asr-005997
07:18:19.420 --> 07:18:24.478
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Precisely, it is, uh?

asr-005999
07:18:26.280 --> 07:18:29.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: We can call it a long-range weapon, something like 1,600 kilometers

asr-006000
07:18:29.440 --> 07:18:33.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mula sa Northern Luzon, abot na abot sa, hindi lang sa Taiwan,

asr-006001
07:18:33.240 --> 07:18:34.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kung hindi kahit sa mainland China.

asr-006002
07:18:36.180 --> 07:18:41.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At hindi lang dineploy doon, nananatili pa rin nakadeploy ngayon,

asr-006003
07:18:41.460 --> 07:18:45.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and just recently, a few months ago, there was a test firing

asr-006004
07:18:45.660 --> 07:18:50.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the Typhoon missile system from Tacloban Airport

asr-006005
07:18:50.400 --> 07:18:56.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tapos yung target, the test target was in Fort Magsaysay in Nueva Ecija,

asr-006006
07:18:57.020 --> 07:18:58.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: over 600 kilometers daw.

asr-006007
07:18:59.680 --> 07:19:04.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, so ano ibig sabihin nun?

asr-006008
07:19:04.840 --> 07:19:12.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Does that not contradict the open pronouncements of the President himself

asr-006009
07:19:12.340 --> 07:19:18.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the NSC now, na hindi pa hihintulutan ng Pilipinas na maging lunsaran,

asr-006010
07:19:18.960 --> 07:19:28.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: eh meron nga offensive missile system ang mga Amerikano dito

asr-006011
07:19:28.620 --> 07:19:30.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at hindi lang yun, tinesting pa nila.

asr-006012
07:19:32.460 --> 07:19:37.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At malinaw naman, gagamitin yun, hindi sa loob ng Pilipinas.

asr-006013
07:19:37.860 --> 07:19:41.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung hindi gagamitin yun, for offensive purposes,

asr-006014
07:19:42.460 --> 07:19:48.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: against, in the end, it will be against China in the Taiwan conflict.

asr-006015
07:19:48.100 --> 07:19:48.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, paano po yun?

asr-006016
07:19:48.840 --> 07:19:48.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paano po yun?

asr-006017
07:19:48.940 --> 07:19:49.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: How do we reconcile?

asr-006018
07:19:50.680 --> 07:19:55.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sabi ng Pangulo, no offensive weapons, no attacks from the Philippines,

asr-006019
07:19:55.400 --> 07:20:01.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and yet, nag-host ng offensive missile system,

asr-006020
07:20:02.920 --> 07:20:06.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: with such capability, the Typhoon missile system, ang US.

asr-006021
07:20:06.740 --> 07:20:09.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano pong paliwanag ng NSC dito?

asr-006022
07:20:10.480 --> 07:20:15.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Mr. Speaker, the stance of the NSC is that

asr-006023
07:20:15.640 --> 07:20:18.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: these exercises actually are exercise of,

asr-006024
07:20:18.940 --> 07:20:20.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: of Philippine sovereignty.

asr-006025
07:20:21.040 --> 07:20:23.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With, particularly, with this launcher,

asr-006026
07:20:24.280 --> 07:20:27.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: this is an assessment of the capabilities,

asr-006027
07:20:28.900 --> 07:20:32.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: also of the Philippines, with regards to its defense posture.

asr-006028
07:20:33.280 --> 07:20:40.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, it's not in itself an offensive exercise.

asr-006029
07:20:41.320 --> 07:20:46.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's really just to measure and assess the capabilities of the Philippines

asr-006030
07:20:46.060 --> 07:20:48.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with regards to defending its territory, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006031
07:20:48.940 --> 07:20:51.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, thank you for that.

asr-006032
07:20:51.740 --> 07:20:53.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Well, I just wanted to point out here,

asr-006033
07:20:53.920 --> 07:20:58.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: there seems to be a contradiction between the public pronouncements

asr-006034
07:20:58.840 --> 07:21:01.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of the President himself, no less than the President.

asr-006035
07:21:01.860 --> 07:21:05.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sinasabi niya sa local and international audiences

asr-006036
07:21:05.100 --> 07:21:10.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na hindi niya papaintulutan na gamitin ang teritoryo ng Pilipinas

asr-006037
07:21:10.240 --> 07:21:15.240
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: para gawing lunsaran ng atake, lalo na ng US,

asr-006038
07:21:15.840 --> 07:21:18.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dahil ayaw natin maging party sa conflict.

asr-006039
07:21:18.920 --> 07:21:25.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: On the other hand, patuloy naman ang pag-host

asr-006040
07:21:25.300 --> 07:21:31.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng, ayun na nga, those very offensive weapon systems

asr-006041
07:21:31.540 --> 07:21:34.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: that only have one use.

asr-006042
07:21:35.180 --> 07:21:38.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The only purpose of the US for that is to attack, obviously.

asr-006043
07:21:41.180 --> 07:21:48.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: It's an adversary in whatever conflict, diba?

asr-006044
07:21:48.920 --> 07:21:50.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun po, pinopoint out natin.

asr-006045
07:21:51.440 --> 07:21:56.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Either pagkakatiwalaan natin ang sinabi ng Pangulo

asr-006046
07:21:56.900 --> 07:22:02.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: o hindi buong katapatan ang naririnig natin

asr-006047
07:22:02.400 --> 07:22:03.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kaugnay sa patakarang ito.

asr-006048
07:22:03.840 --> 07:22:04.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Meron pong kontradiksyon.

asr-006049
07:22:05.360 --> 07:22:06.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yun po ang pinopoint out natin.

asr-006050
07:22:07.260 --> 07:22:08.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, needless to say,

asr-006051
07:22:09.740 --> 07:22:14.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang punto rito, kung totoo ang sinasabi ng Pangulo

asr-006052
07:22:14.320 --> 07:22:16.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at ang patakaran ng NSC,

asr-006053
07:22:16.920 --> 07:22:18.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay dapat i-withdrawal.

asr-006054
07:22:18.920 --> 07:22:23.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I-withdraw yung typhoon missile system na yan.

asr-006055
