asr-006304
07:29:59.320 --> 07:29:59.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So,

asr-006305
07:29:59.460 --> 07:29:59.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yun ang tawag.

asr-006306
07:30:00.000 --> 07:30:08.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: situational awareness and knowledge of the ideological, political, and organizational works of the CPP, NPA, and DF,

asr-006307
07:30:08.660 --> 07:30:13.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including human rights and international humanitarian law violations.

asr-006308
07:30:14.840 --> 07:30:23.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The task force vigorously undertook information, education, and advocacy campaigns through fora, seminars, and conferences

asr-006309
07:30:23.800 --> 07:30:29.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in schools, government offices, and communities, as well as strategic communication initiatives.

asr-006310
07:30:30.000 --> 07:30:37.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Strategic communication initiatives through various media platforms.

asr-006311
07:30:38.480 --> 07:30:44.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At the same time, situational awareness among stakeholders within the international community was enhanced

asr-006312
07:30:44.600 --> 07:30:51.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: through international engagement with the United Nations system, regional or multilateral educations,

asr-006313
07:30:51.420 --> 07:30:59.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: international development and donor agencies, overseas Filipino workers and communities, and foreign states.

asr-006314
07:31:00.000 --> 07:31:03.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, I will read it now.

asr-006315
07:31:04.080 --> 07:31:10.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: The other ones, sectoral empowerment and protection, notably of the children, youth, and student sectors,

asr-006316
07:31:11.060 --> 07:31:14.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: against CPP, NPA, and DF recruitment were vigorously promoted.

asr-006317
07:31:16.040 --> 07:31:19.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Among the significant undertakings are the following,

asr-006318
07:31:20.740 --> 07:31:27.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the PNP-initiated community-based partnerships such as the Kabataan Contra Droga at Terrorismo,

asr-006319
07:31:27.140 --> 07:31:29.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which mobilized the youth as partners,

asr-006320
07:31:30.000 --> 07:31:32.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in addressing drug abuse and terrorism,

asr-006321
07:31:33.340 --> 07:31:37.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and the Kapulisan, Simbahan, at Pamayanan, Kasimbayanan program,

asr-006322
07:31:38.680 --> 07:31:45.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: which served as a platform of collaboration between PNP faith-based organizations and other stakeholders

asr-006323
07:31:45.740 --> 07:31:48.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to ensure peace and order and safety in the communities.

asr-006324
07:31:49.380 --> 07:31:57.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, collaboration between government and parents organizations such as Yakap ng Magulang and Hands of Our Children,

asr-006325
07:31:57.340 --> 07:31:59.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: in the advocacy.

asr-006326
07:32:00.000 --> 07:32:03.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ...against CPP-NPA's recruitment of children,

asr-006327
07:32:03.360 --> 07:32:07.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: initiatives of the department of education and the commission on higher education

asr-006328
07:32:08.660 --> 07:32:14.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to strengthen the integration of peace and education in basic and higher education, respectively,

asr-006329
07:32:14.820 --> 07:32:23.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and DEP-EDS closure of the CPP-NPA-NDF-operated salugpungan schools in Mindanao

asr-006330
07:32:23.840 --> 07:32:26.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: to protect young IEP learners from recruitment.

asr-006331
07:32:27.380 --> 07:32:27.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-006332
07:32:28.640 --> 07:32:29.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So...

asr-006333
07:32:30.000 --> 07:32:35.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung babasahin mo, parang napakabanayad ng mga pangyayari at nakamit ang mga tagumpay.

asr-006334
07:32:35.760 --> 07:32:39.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero sa totoo lang, yung binabangit ng pangyayari dito,

asr-006335
07:32:39.440 --> 07:32:51.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ito yung ilang taon ng marahas na red tagging, harassment, violation of civil rights and human rights

asr-006336
07:32:51.020 --> 07:33:02.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: of individuals from a very wide spectrum of society mula sa mga profesional, sa mga guro,

asr-006337
07:33:02.500 --> 07:33:12.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa mga kawani, sa gobyerno, sa labas ng gobyerno, media, pati mga artista, mga workers, mga unionists,

asr-006338
07:33:13.520 --> 07:33:16.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: mga indigenous peoples, and so on and so forth.

asr-006339
07:33:17.320 --> 07:33:20.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alam natin yan, yung red tagging. Kaya nga, alam na natin.

asr-006340
07:33:20.780 --> 07:33:24.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At tumatak talaga yung issue ng red tagging. This is it.

asr-006341
07:33:25.500 --> 07:33:37.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung sinasabing situational awareness and strategic communication initiatives.

asr-006342
07:33:37.820 --> 07:33:46.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ayan po yung constant red tagging on social media using paid trolls and so on and so forth.

asr-006343
07:33:48.340 --> 07:33:50.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Using government resources.

asr-006344
07:33:50.780 --> 07:34:04.000
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung Supreme Court mismo, naglabas ng ruling, yung kaugnay sa writ of amparo, yung deduro ruling,

asr-006345
07:34:04.420 --> 07:34:13.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: na nagsabi, red tagging is dangerous for the targets of red tagging.

asr-006346
07:34:14.620 --> 07:34:17.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun po ang point natin dito.

asr-006347
07:34:20.780 --> 07:34:28.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang paglalahad ng mga pangyayari, makikita mo na lang sa bandang dulo dahil may sinabi doon yung pinasara yung mga salugpungan schools.

asr-006348
07:34:29.380 --> 07:34:33.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And that was by no means a peaceful process.

asr-006349
07:34:34.560 --> 07:34:39.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Kung hindi, madugo po yan. Literally, in some cases, may mga namatay po.

asr-006350
07:34:40.340 --> 07:34:48.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Maraming pinalikas, maraming mga na-detain, may mga nag-disappear, and so on and so forth.

asr-006351
07:34:48.600 --> 07:34:49.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-006352
07:34:49.900 --> 07:34:50.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So,

asr-006353
07:34:50.780 --> 07:34:52.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yun po yung unang nire-rehistro natin.

asr-006354
07:34:53.600 --> 07:34:55.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And then, to illustrate my point,

asr-006355
07:34:56.720 --> 07:34:57.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi po natatapos to

asr-006356
07:34:57.880 --> 07:35:00.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dun sa panahon ng nakaraang administrasyon,

asr-006357
07:35:00.640 --> 07:35:02.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kundi nagpapatuloy hanggang ngayon.

asr-006358
07:35:03.180 --> 07:35:05.480
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Let me take the case of

asr-006359
07:35:05.480 --> 07:35:10.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the Alliance of Concerned Teachers Region 5 Union.

asr-006360
07:35:11.560 --> 07:35:14.620
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yung Alliance of Concerned Teachers,

asr-006361
07:35:14.840 --> 07:35:16.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pinanggalingan kong organisasyon yan.

asr-006362
07:35:17.080 --> 07:35:20.380
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I used to be the national chairperson of ACT.

asr-006363
07:35:20.780 --> 07:35:24.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: From 2002 to 2012.

asr-006364
07:35:25.300 --> 07:35:30.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, then I became a member of the House through ACT Teachers Party List.

asr-006365
07:35:31.340 --> 07:35:39.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pero, isa sa mga pinagsikapan at pinaghirapan ng Alliance of Concerned Teachers throughout the country.

asr-006366
07:35:39.360 --> 07:35:41.780
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: With the indulgence of the Honorable Tinio, please.

asr-006367
07:35:41.800 --> 07:35:43.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo, patapos na po tayo.

asr-006368
07:35:43.840 --> 07:35:48.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ay ang pag-unionize ng mga public school teachers.

asr-006369
07:35:48.780 --> 07:35:50.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, ACT Region 5.

asr-006370
07:35:50.780 --> 07:35:58.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang pag-union is the sole and accredited negotiating unit.

asr-006371
07:35:58.880 --> 07:36:01.340
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung tanging union na accredited

asr-006372
07:36:01.340 --> 07:36:04.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng gobyerno, ng Civil Service Commission,

asr-006373
07:36:05.280 --> 07:36:07.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng Department of Labor and Employment,

asr-006374
07:36:07.280 --> 07:36:07.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at ng DepEd.

asr-006375
07:36:09.220 --> 07:36:10.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bilang union

asr-006376
07:36:10.940 --> 07:36:14.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng more than 50,000 teachers

asr-006377
07:36:14.100 --> 07:36:17.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng DepEd sa Region 5.

asr-006378
07:36:17.920 --> 07:36:18.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bicol Region.

asr-006379
07:36:19.300 --> 07:36:20.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para makakreditsin,

asr-006380
07:36:20.780 --> 07:36:24.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: kailangan ipakita mo na supportado ka ng mayorya ng mga teacher.

asr-006381
07:36:25.460 --> 07:36:27.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, may pirmahan yan.

asr-006382
07:36:28.380 --> 07:36:31.360
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And you have to get, hindi po biro na makuha mo

asr-006383
07:36:31.360 --> 07:36:34.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang pirma at supporta

asr-006384
07:36:34.520 --> 07:36:39.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng more than, the majority, in short,

asr-006385
07:36:39.840 --> 07:36:42.920
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: the majority of public school teachers throughout the region.

asr-006386
07:36:43.080 --> 07:36:45.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Mula kamarinis norte hanggang Sorsogon.

asr-006387
07:36:45.900 --> 07:36:49.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pagkakita ko si Pongwowo dito.

asr-006388
07:36:49.280 --> 07:36:50.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yan, Sorsogon.

asr-006389
07:36:50.780 --> 07:36:51.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay?

asr-006390
07:36:52.140 --> 07:36:53.600
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sila po ang accredited union.

asr-006391
07:36:54.100 --> 07:36:57.680
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: And on August 2930,

asr-006392
07:36:58.700 --> 07:37:03.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nag-conduct sila ng Regional Leadership Training and Seminar,

asr-006393
07:37:04.240 --> 07:37:07.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung ACT Bicol Region Union.

asr-006394
07:37:08.580 --> 07:37:09.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon, ang nangyari po,

asr-006395
07:37:10.620 --> 07:37:11.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: syempre dahil legal na,

asr-006396
07:37:12.060 --> 07:37:13.500
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: recognized union,

asr-006397
07:37:13.620 --> 07:37:14.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: naglabas ng memo

asr-006398
07:37:14.800 --> 07:37:18.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang DepEd Region 5

asr-006399
07:37:18.180 --> 07:37:20.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for the activity.

asr-006400
07:37:20.780 --> 07:37:25.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: That memo included a list of all the participants

asr-006401
07:37:25.320 --> 07:37:29.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa iba't-ibang mga divisions ng Region 5.

asr-006402
07:37:30.320 --> 07:37:32.520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Listahan, marami po. Mahaba yung listahan.

asr-006403
07:37:33.260 --> 07:37:35.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: More than 100, yung pangalan.

asr-006404
07:37:37.040 --> 07:37:39.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ang nangyari po, ang nakarating sa atin na ulat,

asr-006405
07:37:40.060 --> 07:37:42.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: particular sa Kamarines Sur,

asr-006406
07:37:43.040 --> 07:37:46.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay nahawakan ng PNP

asr-006407
07:37:46.460 --> 07:37:50.140
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung memo, dahil nakapost yan sa

asr-006408
07:37:50.140 --> 07:37:52.320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: website ng DepEd,

asr-006409
07:37:53.140 --> 07:37:53.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung advisory,

asr-006410
07:37:54.620 --> 07:37:55.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: nahawakan ng listahan,

asr-006411
07:37:55.960 --> 07:37:56.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: tapos inisa-isa po

asr-006412
07:37:56.980 --> 07:37:59.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: yung mga pangalan

asr-006413
07:37:59.400 --> 07:38:01.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng memo.

asr-006414
07:38:02.400 --> 07:38:05.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: At either tinawagan sila,

asr-006415
07:38:05.560 --> 07:38:08.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: minessage ng mga nagpapakilalang

asr-006416
07:38:08.160 --> 07:38:10.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: intelligence officer ng PNP,

asr-006417
07:38:11.500 --> 07:38:11.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at

asr-006418
07:38:11.800 --> 07:38:16.080
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hinihingan pa ng pangalan ng mga iba.

asr-006419
07:38:16.080 --> 07:38:18.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa tinawagan, o kaya pinuntahan.

asr-006420
07:38:19.520 --> 07:38:20.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pinuntahan.

asr-006421
07:38:20.140 --> 07:38:21.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sa mga iskwelahan.

asr-006422
07:38:21.640 --> 07:38:22.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sample lang po,

asr-006423
07:38:23.140 --> 07:38:23.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mga...

asr-006424
07:38:23.900 --> 07:38:24.900
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Honorable Tinio, please.

asr-006425
07:38:25.240 --> 07:38:26.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Opo. Opo. Patapos na po.

asr-006426
07:38:27.120 --> 07:38:27.840
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sample lang po.

asr-006427
07:38:28.580 --> 07:38:29.720
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: This is for the record.

asr-006428
07:38:30.440 --> 07:38:32.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, hindi po natin babangitin yung mga pangalan,

asr-006429
07:38:32.860 --> 07:38:33.700
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pero for example,

asr-006430
07:38:35.100 --> 07:38:37.980
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: from screenshots,

asr-006431
07:38:38.160 --> 07:38:39.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ng mga pinadala sa atin.

asr-006432
07:38:40.640 --> 07:38:41.900
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Good afternoon po.

asr-006433
07:38:42.420 --> 07:38:42.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ma'am,

asr-006434
07:38:43.560 --> 07:38:45.100
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pwede po daw tumawag sa inyo?

asr-006435
07:38:47.360 --> 07:38:49.060
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sino po? Ano po ang concern nyo?

asr-006436
07:38:50.140 --> 07:38:52.280
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tawag po ako sa inyo.

asr-006437
07:38:53.380 --> 07:38:56.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Pasensya na po. Sa PNP ako. May query lang, ma'am.

asr-006438
07:38:57.480 --> 07:38:58.400
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano po ang concern nyo?

asr-006439
07:39:00.340 --> 07:39:02.660
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Asking lang, please, regarding sa names,

asr-006440
07:39:02.780 --> 07:39:04.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: including sa mga umaten sa Ligaspi.

asr-006441
07:39:05.520 --> 07:39:06.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ima gano'n, hinihingan ng pangalan.

asr-006442
07:39:07.580 --> 07:39:08.780
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay, meron namang. Iba pa to.

asr-006443
07:39:12.180 --> 07:39:15.120
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito po. If aware kayo kung sino ang representative

asr-006444
07:39:15.120 --> 07:39:17.440
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: from this school, may pangalan ng school,

asr-006445
07:39:17.440 --> 07:39:19.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: or designated lang po to attend,

asr-006446
07:39:20.140 --> 07:39:22.180
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: security survey lang po.

asr-006447
07:39:22.500 --> 07:39:23.260
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, yun ang tawag.

asr-006448
07:39:24.020 --> 07:39:26.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O di kaya, another quote,

asr-006449
07:39:28.020 --> 07:39:30.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: di naman po kami profiling sa inyo.

asr-006450
07:39:30.600 --> 07:39:32.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Nagva-validate lang po kami

