Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, hindi ko na lang isa-isahin kung saang banda.

asr-006631
07:49:40.220 --> 07:49:46.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero, bakit mababa yung budget utilization ninyo sa 2025?

asr-006632
07:49:48.440 --> 07:49:53.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As per the agency po, Mr. Speaker, may mga delay lang daw po sa procurement.

asr-006633
07:49:53.900 --> 07:49:57.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Dahil po, buhat nung nangyari po.

asr-006634
07:49:57.180 --> 07:50:00.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Sa, ano, straight to foremost, marami pong na-delay na ICT equipment.

asr-006635
07:50:01.220 --> 07:50:05.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Nagka-problema din po sa procurement kasi tumaas po yung mga materyales.

asr-006636
07:50:05.460 --> 07:50:07.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, nagka-problema sa, ano.

asr-006637
07:50:07.860 --> 07:50:09.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, hindi na ito magamit.

asr-006638
07:50:10.620 --> 07:50:14.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung hindi ninyo nagamit previous year, hindi na talaga ito magamit.

asr-006639
07:50:21.820 --> 07:50:25.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As per the agency, Mr. Speaker, continuing naman daw po.

asr-006640
07:50:25.620 --> 07:50:26.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, magagamit pa.

asr-006641
07:50:27.180 --> 07:50:30.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Itong 250 million, no, in confidential expenses.

asr-006642
07:50:33.920 --> 07:50:41.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Dito sa hiningin ninyong 250 million, halos kapariha lang ito sa 2026.

asr-006643
07:50:41.460 --> 07:50:50.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: But, you did not identify the targets, ano yung sources or operations, no?

asr-006644
07:50:51.660 --> 07:50:57.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pwede bang ma-devolve yung utilization

asr-006645
07:50:57.180 --> 07:51:05.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: saan natin ito gagamitin without, of course, breaching the national security aspect?

asr-006646
07:51:07.660 --> 07:51:12.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi ko lang maintindihan kasi humihingi tayo, hindi naman natin nagamit.

asr-006647
07:51:12.560 --> 07:51:15.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi natin na-identify saan gagamitin.

asr-006659
07:52:53.040 --> 07:53:10.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Actually, marami akong tanong, pero naawa ako sa sponsor. Kaibigan ko iyan, so dalawa na lang, last two na lang. Pag nasagot iyan, last two out of eight. Walo pa sana yung tanong ko, pero mahirap ipa-defer yung National Security Council.

asr-006661
07:53:26.340 --> 07:53:30.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleague. Thank you for your patience.

asr-006662
07:53:30.660 --> 07:53:35.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yung listahan po, isasubmit na lang po namin yung poll.

asr-006663
07:53:35.640 --> 07:53:38.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Pero ang pwede ko lang po sabihin para po dun sa confidential funds,

asr-006664
07:53:39.680 --> 07:53:43.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yung National Review of Foreign Investments on Military Cybersecurity,

asr-006665
07:53:44.660 --> 07:53:47.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yung 360 Archipelagic Security Governance,

asr-006666
07:53:48.620 --> 07:53:53.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the Protection of Critical Information Infrastructure through Cybersecurity Efforts,

asr-006667
07:53:54.220 --> 07:53:55.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Crisis Management,

asr-006668
07:53:57.040 --> 07:54:02.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Tapos counter-intelligence operations.

asr-006669
07:54:02.160 --> 07:54:04.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay. So, with?

asr-006670
07:54:04.080 --> 07:54:07.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, Mr. Speaker, kung nahihirapan kayo sa procurement,

asr-006671
07:54:07.840 --> 07:54:15.120
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I suggest the sponsor will introduce a special provision na

asr-006672
07:54:15.120 --> 07:54:20.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: sana i-release ni DBM first quarter pa para may time pa kayo to procure.

asr-006673
07:54:21.140 --> 07:54:25.040
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi annual ka mo yung procurement.

asr-006674
07:54:25.040 --> 07:54:30.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi madidiado tayo sa ating National Security Airport.

asr-006675
07:54:30.480 --> 07:54:30.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kayo pa.

asr-006676
07:54:30.720 --> 07:54:33.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pa naman ang taga-advice ni Presidente.

asr-006677
07:54:33.440 --> 07:54:35.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, ito yung second to the last.

asr-006678
07:54:35.940 --> 07:54:40.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nakita ko, yung operations increased from approximately,

asr-006679
07:54:40.960 --> 07:54:43.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung expenses sa operations,

asr-006680
07:54:44.220 --> 07:54:54.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: increased from approximately 295 million in 2026 to 525 million in 2027,

asr-006681
07:54:54.760 --> 07:55:00.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: while the general administration, bumaba siya by more than one half.

asr-006682
07:55:00.720 --> 07:55:03.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po nire-classify natin ito?

asr-006683
07:55:09.040 --> 07:55:11.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Is this a genuine,

asr-006684
07:55:12.300 --> 07:55:21.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: is this only a genuine shift of resources towards the frontline national security functions

asr-006685
07:55:21.660 --> 07:55:25.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: or primarily an accounting program?

asr-006686
07:55:25.260 --> 07:55:30.680
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Accounting lang para nilipat lang natin ang,

asr-006687
07:55:30.720 --> 07:55:31.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ng ibang account code.

asr-006688
07:55:33.140 --> 07:55:34.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nire-classify lang natin.

asr-006689
07:55:35.660 --> 07:55:38.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sinunod lang natin yung definition ng accounting,

asr-006690
07:55:38.480 --> 07:55:39.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: accounting is an art.

asr-006691
07:55:44.100 --> 07:55:46.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As per the agency, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006692
07:55:47.400 --> 07:55:49.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kaya daw po bumaba yung sa gas,

asr-006693
07:55:49.960 --> 07:55:53.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kasi may reclassification po ng ibang mga programa.

asr-006694
07:55:54.180 --> 07:55:56.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, may mga gas daw po na,

asr-006695
07:55:56.440 --> 07:56:00.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: may mga programa po na previously classified under the gas.

asr-006696
07:56:00.720 --> 07:56:02.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Pinasok daw po siya sa support to operations.

asr-006697
07:56:02.780 --> 07:56:04.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nilipat lang ng ibang account code.

asr-006698
07:56:05.980 --> 07:56:06.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes po.

asr-006699
07:56:06.280 --> 07:56:07.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nire-classify nga lang.

asr-006700
07:56:08.340 --> 07:56:10.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, a matter of accounting lang ito.

asr-006701
07:56:10.720 --> 07:56:14.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi maapektuhan yung ating trabaho.

asr-006702
07:56:14.860 --> 07:56:16.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: A matter of accounting lang.

asr-006703
07:56:16.880 --> 07:56:19.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Baka may audit observation kayo, kaya nilipat ninyo?

asr-006704
07:56:20.720 --> 07:56:21.640
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya nilipat ninyo?

asr-006705
07:56:22.500 --> 07:56:23.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Wala naman po.

asr-006706
07:56:23.520 --> 07:56:23.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay.

asr-006707
07:56:24.100 --> 07:56:24.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you.

asr-006708
07:56:24.700 --> 07:56:25.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, last.

asr-006709
07:56:26.740 --> 07:56:28.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero sana may anim pa.

asr-006710
07:56:29.100 --> 07:56:30.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Hindi ko maintindihan yung,

asr-006711
07:56:30.500 --> 07:56:32.360
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: performance indicators ninyo.

asr-006712
07:56:33.360 --> 07:56:35.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I don't know if this is part of the

asr-006713
07:56:35.660 --> 07:56:40.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: national security aspect, no?

asr-006714
07:56:41.080 --> 07:56:42.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Your target, halimbawa,

asr-006715
07:56:42.880 --> 07:56:44.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: for essential elements

asr-006716
07:56:44.760 --> 07:56:46.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: of information,

asr-006717
07:56:48.260 --> 07:56:50.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 2026 is 548.

asr-006718
07:56:51.300 --> 07:56:53.500
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pero yung actual accomplishment ninyo is

asr-006719
07:56:53.500 --> 07:56:56.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: 5,510.

asr-006720
07:56:56.620 --> 07:56:58.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: More than 10 times the target.

asr-006721
07:56:58.660 --> 07:57:00.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po?

asr-006722
07:57:00.500 --> 07:57:05.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mag-target ng 548 pero ma-complace 5,500.

asr-006723
07:57:23.860 --> 07:57:25.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Yung ibang agency kasi,

asr-006724
07:57:25.840 --> 07:57:27.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hirap pa nga sila makuha yung target nila.

asr-006725
07:57:28.640 --> 07:57:29.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sana BIR kayo.

asr-006726
07:57:30.500 --> 07:57:33.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Target 500, makulikta 1,500.

asr-006727
07:57:33.340 --> 07:57:35.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ako, 5,500.

asr-006728
07:57:37.040 --> 07:57:37.900
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Bakit po ganun?

asr-006729
07:57:37.900 --> 07:57:39.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Times 10 yung accomplishment.

asr-006730
07:57:43.560 --> 07:57:44.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Typo?

asr-006731
07:57:44.160 --> 07:57:44.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Typo lang yan?

asr-006732
07:57:44.940 --> 07:57:49.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: O talagang tama yung number na yan?

asr-006747
07:58:03.860 --> 07:58:09.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Mr. Speaker, as per the agency po, kaya po medyo

asr-006748
07:58:09.260 --> 07:58:13.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: mataas po compared to the target. Depende daw po sa incidents.

asr-006749
07:58:13.620 --> 07:58:15.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Depende sa?

asr-006750
07:58:15.920 --> 07:58:24.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Incidents. So, with regard to kung ilan po yung essential elements na kailangang kunin, kaya po medyo tumaas po.

asr-006763
07:58:24.580 --> 07:58:28.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Again, I am not satisfied with the answer.

asr-006768
07:58:28.880 --> 07:58:32.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: May mali talaga sa projection ninyo.

asr-006769
07:58:32.800 --> 07:58:36.080
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi dapat matalas yung ano ninyo,

asr-006770
07:58:36.160 --> 07:58:39.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: National Security Advisor kayo ni Presidente,

asr-006771
07:58:39.200 --> 07:58:41.340
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: tapos sa target man lang ng accomplishment,

asr-006772
07:58:41.580 --> 07:58:46.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: napakalayo, 10 times yung error.

asr-006773
07:58:46.320 --> 07:58:48.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So yung margin of error sa susunod,

asr-006774
07:58:49.140 --> 07:58:50.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: nandito pa ako sa susunod,

asr-006775
07:58:50.500 --> 07:58:51.860
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: hindi pa matapos yung term ko,

asr-006776
07:58:52.360 --> 07:58:53.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: titignan ko ulit yan.

asr-006777
07:58:54.180 --> 07:58:58.620
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Can we expect that almost accurate, realistic?

asr-006778
07:58:58.620 --> 07:59:01.280
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Huwag kayo mag-target ng 500,

asr-006779
07:59:01.560 --> 07:59:03.880
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ang accomplishment 5,500?

asr-006780
07:59:04.140 --> 07:59:05.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi medyo nakakaduda na po yan.

asr-006781
07:59:07.220 --> 07:59:09.400
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Would you agree with me, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006782
07:59:09.640 --> 07:59:10.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006783
07:59:10.520 --> 07:59:13.460
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: na nakakaduda na po yung mag-target ka 500,

asr-006784
07:59:13.700 --> 07:59:15.520
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: ma-accomplish mo 5,500?

asr-006785
07:59:17.760 --> 07:59:18.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tama po ba?

asr-006786
07:59:19.340 --> 07:59:21.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Malayo po talaga, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006787
07:59:21.640 --> 07:59:25.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Though, ang sabi po ng NSA,

asr-006788
07:59:25.900 --> 07:59:26.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: NSE,

asr-006789
07:59:26.740 --> 07:59:27.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kasi po,

asr-006790
07:59:27.880 --> 07:59:28.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: depended daw po,

asr-006791
07:59:28.620 --> 07:59:30.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: talaga sa number of incidents.

asr-006792
07:59:30.400 --> 07:59:31.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Okay, sige.

asr-006793
07:59:35.480 --> 07:59:36.940
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tinanggal ko na, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006794
07:59:37.100 --> 07:59:38.780
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: yung anim na katanungan

asr-006795
07:59:38.780 --> 07:59:39.420
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: kasi alam ko,

asr-006796
07:59:39.500 --> 07:59:41.020
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: mahirapan sila magsagot.

asr-006797
07:59:41.540 --> 07:59:43.660
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Inaantok na rin po yung presiding officer.

asr-006798
07:59:44.660 --> 07:59:46.700
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006799
07:59:46.920 --> 07:59:47.720
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-006800
07:59:47.800 --> 07:59:49.560
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: malaming salamat sa kasagutan.

asr-006801
07:59:50.320 --> 07:59:52.740
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: There being no other members from the minority

asr-006802
07:59:52.740 --> 07:59:54.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: who wanted to interpelate,

asr-006803
07:59:54.760 --> 07:59:57.960
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I move to terminate the period of interpellation

