Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a motion to consider

asr-006852
08:04:27.500 --> 08:04:29.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: the budget of the National

asr-006853
08:04:29.160 --> 08:04:29.960
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Amnesty Commission.

asr-006854
08:04:30.000 --> 08:04:31.900
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Is there any objection?

asr-006855
08:04:32.680 --> 08:04:34.320
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Hearing none. Motion is carried.

asr-006856
08:04:35.180 --> 08:04:36.040
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-006857
08:04:36.480 --> 08:04:38.120
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, may we acknowledge

asr-006858
08:04:38.120 --> 08:04:40.420
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: the heads and officials of the

asr-006859
08:04:40.420 --> 08:04:41.940
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: National Amnesty Commission,

asr-006860
08:04:42.460 --> 08:04:44.540
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: namely Chairperson Leah C.

asr-006861
08:04:45.120 --> 08:04:46.460
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Tanodra Armamento,

asr-006862
08:04:47.040 --> 08:04:47.680
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Commissioner

asr-006863
08:04:47.680 --> 08:04:49.900
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Jamar M.

asr-006864
08:04:50.500 --> 08:04:52.180
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Kulayan, Commissioner

asr-006865
08:04:52.180 --> 08:04:53.980
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Ser-me L.

asr-006866
08:04:54.800 --> 08:04:55.380
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Ayuyao.

asr-006867
08:04:58.398 --> 08:05:00.638
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: To the officers,

asr-006868
08:05:00.638 --> 08:05:03.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: and the heads of the National Amnesty Commission,

asr-006869
08:05:03.160 --> 08:05:07.400
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: namely Chairperson Leah Tanodra Armamento,

asr-006870
08:05:07.400 --> 08:05:10.000
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Commissioner Jamar M. Kulayan,

asr-006871
08:05:10.000 --> 08:05:12.200
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: and Commissioner Ser-me Ayuyao,

asr-006872
08:05:12.200 --> 08:05:15.120
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: on behalf of Speaker Bojie Dy

asr-006873
08:05:15.120 --> 08:05:17.480
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: and Majority Leader Sandro Marcos,

asr-006874
08:05:17.480 --> 08:05:19.280
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Sir, Ma'am, good evening.

asr-006875
08:05:19.280 --> 08:05:21.920
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Welcome to the House of Representatives.

asr-006876
08:05:21.920 --> 08:05:23.920
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader.

asr-006877
08:05:25.200 --> 08:05:29.840
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, I move that we open the period of sponsorship and debate.

asr-006879
08:05:29.840 --> 08:05:35.840
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: I move that we recognize the Honorable Jose Joboy S. Aquino II,

asr-006880
08:05:35.840 --> 08:05:40.240
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Vice Chairperson of Committee on Appropriation

asr-006881
08:05:40.240 --> 08:05:45.240
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: to sponsor the proposed budget of the National Amnesty Commission.

asr-006882
08:05:45.240 --> 08:05:51.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentleman from the Lone District of Butuan, Vice Chair Joboy Aquino,

asr-006883
08:05:51.240 --> 08:05:54.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Mayong Gabie, you are recognized.

asr-006884
08:05:54.240 --> 08:05:57.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes, Mayong Gabie, Mr. Speaker,

asr-006885
08:05:57.240 --> 08:05:59.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: distinguished colleagues,

asr-006886
08:05:59.240 --> 08:06:06.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: it is my privilege to sponsor the proposed budget of the National Amnesty Commission

asr-006887
08:06:06.240 --> 08:06:09.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for the fiscal year 2027,

asr-006888
08:06:09.240 --> 08:06:15.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: amounting to 266,700,000.

asr-006889
08:06:15.240 --> 08:06:23.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: As an institution entrusted with implementing the Government's Amnesty Program

asr-006890
08:06:23.240 --> 08:06:28.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for qualified beneficiaries in accordance with existing laws

asr-006891
08:06:28.240 --> 08:06:30.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and proclamations,

asr-006892
08:06:30.240 --> 08:06:36.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: the Commission plays an important role in supporting the Government's efforts

asr-006893
08:06:36.240 --> 08:06:43.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: towards reconciliation, reintegration, and the promotion of lasting peace

asr-006894
08:06:43.240 --> 08:06:50.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: by providing a lawful mechanism through which qualified individuals

asr-006895
08:06:50.240 --> 08:06:54.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: may avail themselves of amnesty.

asr-006896
08:06:54.240 --> 08:06:57.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Its work requires

asr-006897
08:06:57.240 --> 08:07:05.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: not only the proper evaluation and processing of applicants,

asr-006898
08:07:05.240 --> 08:07:11.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: but also effective coordination with concerned government agencies

asr-006899
08:07:11.240 --> 08:07:16.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to ensure that the objectives of the Amnesty Program

asr-006900
08:07:16.240 --> 08:07:21.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: are carried out efficiently and in accordance with the law.

asr-006901
08:07:21.240 --> 08:07:25.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: As we deliberate on the fiscal year 2027,

asr-006902
08:07:25.240 --> 08:07:30.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: budget of the National Amnesty Commission,

asr-006903
08:07:30.240 --> 08:07:36.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: we recognize the importance of providing the resources necessary

asr-006904
08:07:36.240 --> 08:07:40.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for the Commission to fulfill its mandate

asr-006905
08:07:40.240 --> 08:07:47.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: while ensuring accountability and prudent use of public funds.

asr-006906
08:07:47.240 --> 08:07:53.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: The Commission's appropriations must support the effective administration

asr-006907
08:07:53.240 --> 08:07:56.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: of the Amnesty Program,

asr-006908
08:07:56.240 --> 08:08:01.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: including the processing and issuance of amnesty grants

asr-006909
08:08:01.240 --> 08:08:08.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: as well as the institutional requirements necessary for its operations.

asr-006910
08:08:08.240 --> 08:08:10.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: In view of the foregoing,

asr-006911
08:08:10.240 --> 08:08:14.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: I therefore ask our fellow members of this August Chamber

asr-006912
08:08:14.240 --> 08:08:20.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to support the proposed budget of the National Amnesty Commission

asr-006913
08:08:20.240 --> 08:08:22.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for the successful implementation

asr-006914
08:08:22.240 --> 08:08:26.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: of the Amnesty Program.

asr-006915
08:08:26.240 --> 08:08:28.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006916
08:08:28.240 --> 08:08:34.430
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This representation is now ready to answer questions from our colleagues.

asr-006917
08:08:34.430 --> 08:08:37.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Salamat, Vice Chair Joboy. Majority Leader.

asr-006918
08:08:38.200 --> 08:08:40.240
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, I move that we recognize

asr-006919
08:08:40.240 --> 08:08:45.240
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: the Honorable Presley C. De Jesus from PHILRECA Party-list

asr-006920
08:08:45.240 --> 08:08:50.240
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: to interpellate the proposed budget of the National Amnesty Commission.

asr-006921
08:08:50.240 --> 08:08:52.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentleman from

asr-006922
08:08:52.240 --> 08:08:54.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: PHILRECA Party-list,

asr-006923
08:08:54.240 --> 08:08:58.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Honorable Presley De Jesus.

asr-006924
08:08:58.240 --> 08:09:03.240
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Sir, you may interpellate the sponsor.

asr-006925
08:09:03.240 --> 08:09:05.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006926
08:09:05.240 --> 08:09:07.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I have only a few questions.

asr-006927
08:09:07.240 --> 08:09:12.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: First, the National Amnesty Commission was created precisely

asr-006928
08:09:12.240 --> 08:09:18.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: to receive, process, and determine whether applicants are entitled to amnesty

asr-006929
08:09:18.240 --> 08:09:20.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: under Executive Order No. 125,

asr-006930
08:09:20.240 --> 08:09:23.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: as amended by Executive Order 47.

asr-006931
08:09:23.240 --> 08:09:28.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is the Commission's principal statutory mandate.

asr-006932
08:09:28.240 --> 08:09:32.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The application period for the four amnesty proclamations

asr-006933
08:09:32.240 --> 08:09:37.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: ran from March 2024 until March 2026.

asr-006934
08:09:37.240 --> 08:09:41.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yet, based on the Commission's reported figures,

asr-006935
08:09:41.240 --> 08:09:45.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: only 20 applicants have been granted amnesty

asr-006936
08:09:45.240 --> 08:09:47.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: by the close of the application period,

asr-006937
08:09:47.240 --> 08:09:49.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: out of approximately 16,000 applicants.

asr-006938
08:09:49.240 --> 08:10:01.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: This is equivalent to only 0.1232% of applications received.

asr-006939
08:10:01.240 --> 08:10:05.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: How does the Commission justify this level of output

asr-006940
08:10:05.240 --> 08:10:09.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: after two full years of implementation?

asr-006941
08:10:09.240 --> 08:10:14.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: More importantly, how many of the 16,230 applications

asr-006942
08:10:14.240 --> 08:10:17.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: have actually been fully evaluated and resolved?

asr-006943
08:10:17.240 --> 08:10:22.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Whether approved, denied, or otherwise disposed of?

asr-006944
08:10:22.240 --> 08:10:31.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: And how many remain pending?

asr-006945
08:10:31.240 --> 08:10:38.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-006946
08:10:38.240 --> 08:10:44.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: There were several factors that affect this and reasons.

asr-006947
08:10:44.240 --> 08:10:46.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Number one, the incomplete submitted documents.

asr-006948
08:10:46.240 --> 08:10:51.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Many applications lack documents necessary

asr-006949
08:10:51.240 --> 08:10:54.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for the complete review of the amnesty application.

asr-006950
08:10:54.240 --> 08:10:58.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Requiring them to submit lacking documents

asr-006951
08:10:58.240 --> 08:11:03.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: is challenging due to logistical and financial concerns,

asr-006952
08:11:03.240 --> 08:11:08.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: as well as reluctance of other agencies to coordinate.

asr-006953
08:11:08.240 --> 08:11:14.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: NAC response: continuous streamlining and simplification

asr-006954
08:11:14.240 --> 08:11:19.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: of process, determining which documentary requirements

asr-006955
08:11:19.240 --> 08:11:21.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: can be dispensed with.

asr-006956
08:11:21.240 --> 08:11:26.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Number two, unresponsive and uncooperative agencies.

asr-006957
08:11:26.240 --> 08:11:29.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Some agencies are not familiar with the NAC.

asr-006958
08:11:29.240 --> 08:11:33.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Some are reluctant to share documents with the NAC.

asr-006959
08:11:33.240 --> 08:11:39.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Some use the Data Privacy Act to refuse NAC access

asr-006960
08:11:39.240 --> 08:11:42.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to requested documents.

asr-006961
08:11:42.240 --> 08:11:47.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Continuous engagement with these agencies

asr-006962
08:11:47.240 --> 08:11:50.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to make NAC known to them.

asr-006963
08:11:50.240 --> 08:11:53.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Orientations on the mandate of the NAC,

asr-006964
08:11:53.240 --> 08:11:57.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: reiteration that the request for documents

asr-006965
08:11:57.240 --> 08:12:00.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: is pursuant to NAC's mandate,

asr-006966
08:12:00.240 --> 08:12:04.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: making it official function.

asr-006967
08:12:04.240 --> 08:12:08.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Number three, difficulty in declaring a quorum

asr-006968
08:12:08.240 --> 08:12:10.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: for lab members.

asr-006969
08:12:10.240 --> 08:12:13.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Many amnesty applications need to undergo

asr-006970
08:12:13.240 --> 08:12:16.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: a case conference by lab members.

asr-006971
08:12:16.240 --> 08:12:18.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Each lab has five members,

asr-006972
08:12:18.240 --> 08:12:21.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: which a quorum fixed at three members

asr-006973
08:12:21.240 --> 08:12:24.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to formally constitute a body.

asr-006974
08:12:24.240 --> 08:12:27.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: These lab members are employed primarily

asr-006975
08:12:27.240 --> 08:12:29.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: in different offices.

asr-006976
08:12:29.240 --> 08:12:33.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thus, their schedules are usually difficult to manage,

asr-006977
08:12:33.240 --> 08:12:37.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: resulting in regular meetings.

asr-006978
08:12:37.240 --> 08:12:40.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ensuring honoraria are released

asr-006979
08:12:40.240 --> 08:12:42.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: in a timely manner.

asr-006980
08:12:42.240 --> 08:12:45.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Proper coordination and engagement

asr-006981
08:12:45.240 --> 08:12:46.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: with the lab members,

asr-006982
08:12:46.240 --> 08:12:49.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: capacitating lab secretariat

asr-006983
08:12:49.240 --> 08:12:53.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: on how to coordinate better with lab members.

asr-006984
08:12:53.240 --> 08:12:57.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Number four, different review process.

asr-006985
08:12:57.240 --> 08:13:01.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Review process by the ex-official members

asr-006986
08:13:01.240 --> 08:13:05.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: involve a separate and independent process

asr-006987
08:13:05.240 --> 08:13:07.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and standard.

asr-006988
08:13:07.240 --> 08:13:09.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This takes up time.

asr-006989
08:13:09.240 --> 08:13:13.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: It takes up time that is not within the process

asr-006990
08:13:13.240 --> 08:13:17.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: that can be controlled by NAC.

asr-006991
08:13:17.240 --> 08:13:23.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: NAC response is to continue coordination,

asr-006992
08:13:23.240 --> 08:13:25.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: streamlining of process,

asr-006993
08:13:25.240 --> 08:13:27.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: regular process check,

asr-006994
08:13:27.240 --> 08:13:30.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and technical working group meetings.

asr-006995
08:13:30.240 --> 08:13:32.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Designation of personnel

asr-006996
08:13:32.240 --> 08:13:35.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to specifically follow up

asr-006997
08:13:35.240 --> 08:13:39.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: with each ex-official member.

asr-006998
08:13:39.240 --> 08:13:43.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Number five, low manpower.

asr-006999
08:13:43.240 --> 08:13:47.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: With the postponement of hiring of COS

asr-007000
08:13:47.240 --> 08:13:50.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: imposed by civil service,

asr-007001
08:13:50.240 --> 08:13:57.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: the NAC operates with its limited manpower.

asr-007002
08:13:57.240 --> 08:14:00.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: With the surge of the amnesty application

asr-007003
08:14:00.240 --> 08:14:03.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: received corresponding increase in manpower

asr-007004
08:14:03.240 --> 08:14:08.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to who will process this amnesty application.

asr-007005
08:14:08.240 --> 08:14:10.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Necessary.

asr-007006
08:14:10.240 --> 08:14:12.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: The response of NAC.

asr-007007
08:14:12.240 --> 08:14:16.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Letter request sent to COA DBM

asr-007008
08:14:16.240 --> 08:14:19.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and civil service for an exemption.

asr-007009
08:14:19.240 --> 08:14:22.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Streamlining of process to simplify

asr-007010
08:14:22.240 --> 08:14:26.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: or shorten process for faster processing.

asr-007011
08:14:26.240 --> 08:14:29.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Continuous capacity building

asr-007012
08:14:29.240 --> 08:14:31.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and process checking.

asr-007013
08:14:31.240 --> 08:14:35.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Commitment to deliver NAC mandate

asr-007014
08:14:35.240 --> 08:14:37.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and digitalization.

asr-007015
08:14:37.240 --> 08:14:40.240
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you.

asr-007016
08:14:40.240 --> 08:14:41.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Thank you,

asr-007017
08:14:41.240 --> 08:14:42.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker,

asr-007018
08:14:42.240 --> 08:14:45.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-007019
08:14:45.240 --> 08:14:47.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Record shows that

asr-007020
08:14:47.240 --> 08:14:50.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: there are currently 16,230 pending applicants

asr-007021
08:14:50.240 --> 08:14:52.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: for amnesty.

asr-007022
08:14:52.240 --> 08:14:55.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Yet the data indicates that only

asr-007023
08:14:55.240 --> 08:14:57.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: 20 applications have been approved

asr-007024
08:14:57.240 --> 08:14:59.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: over the past three years.

asr-007025
08:14:59.240 --> 08:15:00.240
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: So we're

