asr-007437
08:32:26.600 --> 08:32:31.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Honorable Colleague, if I may please explain first,

asr-007438
08:32:32.400 --> 08:32:41.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: just like to explain about this National Action Plan on Women, Peace, and Security

asr-007439
08:32:41.280 --> 08:32:48.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and its localization is 2023 to 2033.

asr-007440
08:32:48.840 --> 08:32:55.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: It's being localized through trainings, civil society collaboration, and integration,

asr-007441
08:32:56.600 --> 08:33:05.600
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: of women's peace and security into plans, budgets, and leadership programs.

asr-007442
08:33:06.280 --> 08:33:15.360
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Women's participation expanding in recovery, psychosocial services, and reintegration,

asr-007443
08:33:15.360 --> 08:33:24.720
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: while academic and local partners strengthen leadership capacity through joint action

asr-007444
08:33:24.720 --> 08:33:26.360
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: with other and other.

asr-007445
08:33:26.600 --> 08:33:35.400
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: And as CWPS members, member agencies, such as DOH, DSWD, and TESDA.

asr-007446
08:33:36.280 --> 08:33:48.460
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Persistent gaps include limited data, uneven policy support, and weak integration across programs.

asr-007447
08:33:48.460 --> 08:33:55.460
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Recognizing this, National NAPWPS Dashboard,

asr-007448
08:33:56.600 --> 08:34:05.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: was developed with the DICT, which is set to be public by the end of 2026.

asr-007449
08:34:05.280 --> 08:34:11.140
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Localization and capacity development for LGUs are underway

asr-007450
08:34:11.140 --> 08:34:14.960
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: in 18 provinces nationwide,

asr-007451
08:34:14.960 --> 08:34:19.720
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: with varying status of development.

asr-007452
08:34:20.620 --> 08:34:23.340
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Protection and mainstreaming efforts

asr-007453
08:34:23.360 --> 08:34:28.160
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: provide vulnerable women and girls with social support,

asr-007454
08:34:28.160 --> 08:34:34.360
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: education, health services and inclusion in policy frameworks.

asr-007455
08:34:34.360 --> 08:34:56.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Advocacy platforms like CHEDS, SGPCWs, Tinig ng Kababaihan, and Consultation Amplify, WPS Perspectives, Resource Constraints, Institutional Resistance, and Weak Accountability

asr-007456
08:34:56.780 --> 08:35:03.920
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: We highlight the need for sustained investment and strong buy-in.

asr-007457
08:35:04.320 --> 08:35:18.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Sponsor, to save time, makikihingi na lang po ang kinatawang ito ng yung targets po, yung binabanggit niyo po kanina, on National Action Plan on Women, Peace, and Security.

asr-007458
08:35:18.620 --> 08:35:23.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: If this can be furnished to my office para po makita natin, would that be okay to the OPA Pro?

asr-007459
08:35:24.920 --> 08:35:26.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, of course.

asr-007460
08:35:26.780 --> 08:35:30.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you. Thank you, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007461
08:35:30.700 --> 08:35:31.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you.

asr-007462
08:35:31.100 --> 08:35:43.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Balikan ko po yung punto ko kanina doon sa hinihinging budget at doon sa outcome indicators, performance indicators ng OPA Pro.

asr-007463
08:35:44.460 --> 08:35:47.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Doon sa normalization track kasi merong mga major component yan.

asr-007464
08:35:48.520 --> 08:35:56.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Security, socioeconomic development, confidence building, transitional justice, and reconciliation.

asr-007465
08:35:56.780 --> 08:36:11.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya po yung tanong ko kanina, humihingi o nagre-request ang OPA Pro ng mas mataas na budget, but the targets remain the same.

asr-007466
08:36:12.940 --> 08:36:23.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, bakit nagre-request ng mas papalaking budget ang OPA Pro pero yung targets ay hindi gumagalaw?

asr-007467
08:36:23.060 --> 08:36:26.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, if we're going to take a look into the...

asr-007468
08:36:26.780 --> 08:36:31.260
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Outcome indicators, almost the same since 2022.

asr-007469
08:36:31.800 --> 08:36:46.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 16% 2022, 20% 2024, 20% 2025, 20% ulit 2026, and you are targeting 20% for 2027.

asr-007470
08:36:47.500 --> 08:36:54.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This representation would like to be clarified on the matter, ano ba itong 20% na pinag-uusapan natin?

asr-007471
08:36:54.960 --> 08:36:56.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 20% of what?

asr-007472
08:36:56.780 --> 08:37:00.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Again, the normalization track has major components.

asr-007473
08:37:00.680 --> 08:37:03.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 20% of what ang kinukomplete natin dito?

asr-007474
08:37:04.000 --> 08:37:07.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And the following question to that, why is it only 20%?

asr-007475
08:37:09.040 --> 08:37:16.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In the general targets, but 20%, iplinakda ng 20% since the previous years, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007476
08:37:16.560 --> 08:37:25.660
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes, Honorable Distinguished Colleague, there is a catch-up plan for the MIL.

asr-007477
08:37:25.660 --> 08:37:25.980
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: 20,000.

asr-007478
08:37:26.780 --> 08:37:37.980
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: There are 40,000 MILF combatants, and 26,000.

asr-007479
08:37:39.640 --> 08:37:47.680
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: There are right now 26,145 existing, and we have 40,000 more combatants.

asr-007480
08:37:48.200 --> 08:37:52.520
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: And there is a catch-up plan that will be implemented.

asr-007481
08:37:52.520 --> 08:37:55.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, ito po sa combatants po ito, no?

asr-007482
08:37:56.080 --> 08:37:56.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: For the final...

asr-007483
08:37:56.780 --> 08:37:59.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Phase noong decommissioning.

asr-007484
08:37:59.480 --> 08:38:00.980
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Sa socio-economic plan nito.

asr-007485
08:38:01.240 --> 08:38:02.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, decommissioning.

asr-007486
08:38:02.580 --> 08:38:07.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya nga po, ang tanong ko, doon sa 20%, kasi maraming components yan eh.

asr-007487
08:38:08.060 --> 08:38:09.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano ba yung tina-target ng OPA-PRO?

asr-007488
08:38:10.420 --> 08:38:10.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Doon sa 20%?

asr-007489
08:38:10.880 --> 08:38:11.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Socio-economic.

asr-007490
08:38:12.000 --> 08:38:12.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Socio-economic?

asr-007491
08:38:12.940 --> 08:38:13.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes.

asr-007492
08:38:13.500 --> 08:38:18.200
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, on the socio-economic provisions, doon sa normalization track, 20%.

asr-007493
08:38:18.720 --> 08:38:24.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: What about yung other targets po, other components ng Annex of Normalization?

asr-007494
08:38:25.500 --> 08:38:26.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ano po ang target nito?

asr-007495
08:38:26.780 --> 08:38:28.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Very general po nakalagay.

asr-007496
08:38:29.040 --> 08:38:32.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, 20% across all components po ba ito?

asr-007497
08:38:33.200 --> 08:38:42.760
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang pinakamalaki, kula, colleague, ay ang security, socio-economic, and my partner na security.

asr-007498
08:38:42.760 --> 08:38:42.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Security.

asr-007499
08:38:44.840 --> 08:38:49.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, nasa socio-economic and security component of the normalization.

asr-007500
08:38:50.460 --> 08:38:56.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Sponsor, pwede po bang may we request from the OPA-PRO to...

asr-007501
08:38:56.620 --> 08:39:00.340
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ano pa yung transitional justice?

asr-007502
08:39:01.100 --> 08:39:02.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, part din yung transitional justice.

asr-007503
08:39:02.660 --> 08:39:14.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Sponsor, to save time, kasi hindi po malinaw yung sagot ng OPA-PRO as to the major components of the normalization track.

asr-007504
08:39:15.320 --> 08:39:20.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, makikihingi na lang po ng data, ang kinatawang ito, yung breakdown.

asr-007505
08:39:21.060 --> 08:39:26.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: How much is allocated for security, for transitional justice, reconciliation?

asr-007506
08:39:26.620 --> 08:39:32.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi doon po sa performance indicators ng OPA-PRO, malabo eh. General as 20%.

asr-007507
08:39:32.500 --> 08:39:40.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And in line po sa binanggit nyo kanina, Mr. Sponsor, binanggit nyo yung doon sa decommissioning of MILF combatants.

asr-007508
08:39:41.160 --> 08:39:51.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That is true, no? Nasa fourth and final phase, ang decommissioning involving 14,000 combatants and around 2,450 weapons.

asr-007509
08:39:51.880 --> 08:39:56.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But the latest update to this, and the OPA-PRO would like to clarify,

asr-007510
08:39:56.620 --> 08:40:03.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: clarify this matter, itinigil ito eh. Tama po ba? Itinigil itong fourth phase, Mr. Sponsor?

asr-007511
08:40:03.540 --> 08:40:12.300
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Actually, 26,145 existing and there is a balance of 14,000. Makes it 40,000.

asr-007512
08:40:12.680 --> 08:40:16.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama, Mr. Sponsor. Nakapag-decommission na ng 26,000.

asr-007513
08:40:16.880 --> 08:40:20.460
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes. 26,145.

asr-007514
08:40:20.460 --> 08:40:23.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes. May remaining pa na 14,000.

asr-007515
08:40:23.420 --> 08:40:23.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes.

asr-007516
08:40:23.700 --> 08:40:26.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon, kaya po natigil itong decommissioning.

asr-007517
08:40:26.620 --> 08:40:34.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kaya po natigil itong decommissioning of 14,000 MILF combatants kasi may pronouncement ang MILF.

asr-007518
08:40:34.500 --> 08:40:37.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In fact, this has been issued by the Central Committee of MILF.

asr-007519
08:40:38.480 --> 08:40:50.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In fact, last budget deliberation, Mr. Sponsor, tinigil ito mismo ng MILF dahil hindi nila nakikitaan ng kaseryosuhan

asr-007520
08:40:50.060 --> 08:40:56.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung Government of the Republic of the Philippines in finishing or delivering other components

asr-007521
08:40:56.620 --> 08:40:58.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: of the normalization track.

asr-007522
08:40:58.620 --> 08:41:02.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question to the OPA-PRO is, what is the current status?

asr-007523
08:41:03.200 --> 08:41:13.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi, Mr. Sponsor, nung nakaraang budget deliberation, the MILF has already declared they are losing trust in the peace process

asr-007524
08:41:13.520 --> 08:41:16.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: because of the predecessor of the good secretary.

asr-007525
08:41:16.300 --> 08:41:26.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In fact, they have said in many, in many, in numerous news clippings that the predecessor of the good secretary is a saboteur of peace.

asr-007526
08:41:26.620 --> 08:41:38.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That is why, it is in their position, being the party to the peace negotiation, to stop the decommissioning of 14,000 combatants.

asr-007527
08:41:38.140 --> 08:41:43.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question is, Mr. Sponsor, ano na po yung status ng pag-uusap?

asr-007528
08:41:44.340 --> 08:41:51.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kasi kailangan uli ma-build yung confidence eh na makipag-usap yung other party doon sa table.

asr-007529
08:41:52.520 --> 08:41:56.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And sadly, Mr. Sponsor, and to the good secretary,

asr-007530
08:41:56.620 --> 08:42:05.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sadly, the predecessor of the current secretary has not addressed these grave issues and concerns

asr-007531
08:42:05.100 --> 08:42:07.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as raised by the Moro Islamic Liberation Front.

asr-007532
08:42:08.400 --> 08:42:14.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, what is the status of this decommissioning, the fourth and final phase of decommissioning?

asr-007533
08:42:16.340 --> 08:42:25.080
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes, distinguished colleague, the GPH is targeting to commence phase four decommissioning in 2028.

asr-007534
08:42:26.140 --> 08:42:26.540
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: However,

asr-007535
08:42:26.620 --> 08:42:39.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: the decommissioning is a joint GPH-MILF undertaking and is for further discussion and agreement between the GPH-MILF implementing panels.

asr-007536
08:42:40.800 --> 08:42:42.120
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So, may 2028 po, no?

asr-007537
08:42:42.860 --> 08:42:45.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: 2028, tama po ba, Mr. Sponsor?

asr-007538
08:42:45.900 --> 08:42:48.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: From September 25, no?

asr-007539
08:42:48.380 --> 08:42:56.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: There will be a KL meeting to consider resumption of the decommissioning.

asr-007540
08:42:56.620 --> 08:43:07.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, may, it, that's the OPAP rule confirmed through the sponsor na meron ng positive development on the matter?

asr-007541
08:43:07.920 --> 08:43:13.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: One of the things to be discussed in Kuala Lumpur is the date for the decommissioning.

asr-007542
08:43:26.620 --> 08:43:34.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So, also, for the information of our distinguished colleague, the OPAP head by our secretary,

asr-007543
08:43:36.620 --> 08:43:44.100
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: as chair of the panel of the government, headed by our secretary, Mel Sarmento,

asr-007544
08:43:44.380 --> 08:43:51.500
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: had a very good, productive meeting with Chairman Murad in Darapanan.

asr-007545
08:43:51.500 --> 08:43:55.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That is a very welcome development, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007546
08:43:55.920 --> 08:43:56.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hearing that.

asr-007547
08:43:56.620 --> 08:44:03.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: There is already a positive development regarding the peace negotiation between the GRP and the MILF.

asr-007548
08:44:04.540 --> 08:44:13.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Actually, ito po yung inaantay natin na sagot dahil hindi po ito in-address ng predecessor ng butihing sekretary ngayon.

asr-007549
08:44:13.280 --> 08:44:22.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And in fact, if I can remember correctly, the predecessor of the good secretary has requested for an executive session.

asr-007550
08:44:22.960 --> 08:44:25.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: And yet, wala pong nangyari doon sa executive session.

asr-007551
08:44:25.980 --> 08:44:38.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, maganda pong balita na binabalita po ng OPAPRU na merong productive meeting between GRP and the Moro Islamic Liberation Front through its chair, Chair Alhaj Murad.

asr-007552
08:44:38.600 --> 08:44:52.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Makikihingi na lang po ng datos sa OPAPRU through the sponsor regarding po dito sa timetable sa pagkumpleto ng normalization and reaching the exit agreement,

asr-007553
08:44:52.440 --> 08:44:55.800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: if that document is available.

asr-007554
08:44:55.980 --> 08:44:56.860
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007555
08:44:57.740 --> 08:44:58.940
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes, there is.

asr-007556
08:44:59.740 --> 08:45:00.800
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Distinguished colleague.

asr-007557
08:45:01.260 --> 08:45:02.600
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: By the way,

asr-007558
08:45:02.600 --> 08:45:07.180
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: OPA-PRO is also chair of the government panel.

asr-007559
08:45:08.160 --> 08:45:09.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, yes, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007560
08:45:09.800 --> 08:45:15.160
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: There are two positions of our good Secretary Sarmiento.

asr-007561
08:45:15.620 --> 08:45:18.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, thank you, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007562
08:45:18.860 --> 08:45:22.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, yung mga hinihingi na lang po na dokumento, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007563
08:45:22.760 --> 08:45:25.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes, rest assured, that was...

asr-007564
08:45:25.080 --> 08:45:28.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Moving on, dito po sa...

asr-007565
08:45:29.340 --> 08:45:32.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Well, last year, naging malaking issue ko po ito sa OPA-PRO

asr-007566
08:45:32.840 --> 08:45:37.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: and it wasn't really answered by the previous Secretary.

asr-007567
08:45:37.760 --> 08:45:40.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In the PDP 2024 Midterm Update,

asr-007568
08:45:41.780 --> 08:45:44.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: the progress report, take note, this was the progress report.

asr-007569
08:45:44.780 --> 08:45:47.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: One of the performance indicators

asr-007570
08:45:47.880 --> 08:45:52.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: is to complete the implementation of all signed agreements.

asr-007571
08:45:53.540 --> 08:45:55.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Take note, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-007572
08:45:55.080 --> 08:45:58.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That in 2024 Midterm Update of OPA-PRO,

asr-007573
08:45:59.140 --> 08:46:02.300
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: it was indicated here, green check,

asr-007574
08:46:02.980 --> 08:46:07.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: meaning it is already fully implemented and institutionalized.

asr-007575
08:46:08.460 --> 08:46:12.100
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, kiniklaim ng OPA-PRO in 2024,

asr-007576
08:46:12.940 --> 08:46:16.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sabi nila, fully implemented and completed na itong part na to.

asr-007577
08:46:16.620 --> 08:46:18.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Now, Mr. Sponsor, Mr. Speaker,

asr-007578
08:46:20.200 --> 08:46:23.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: in the 2025 PDP Midterm Update,

asr-007579
08:46:23.380 --> 08:46:25.060
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: what was considered,

asr-007580
08:46:25.080 --> 08:46:28.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: as fully implemented in 2024 PDP,

asr-007581
08:46:28.840 --> 08:46:30.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ngayon, naging dilaw na.

asr-007582
08:46:31.260 --> 08:46:32.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ibig sabihin,

asr-007583
08:46:33.020 --> 08:46:35.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: partially implemented and institutionalized.

asr-007584
08:46:36.300 --> 08:46:38.420
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, ang tanong dito, Mr. Sponsor,

asr-007585
08:46:39.640 --> 08:46:42.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: bakit yung progress report ng OPA-PRO paatras?

asr-007586
08:46:45.940 --> 08:46:49.400
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes, there was a mistake.

asr-007587
08:46:50.220 --> 08:46:51.120
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: It's admitted

asr-007588
08:46:51.120 --> 08:46:53.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: that there was a mistake

asr-007589
08:46:53.280 --> 08:46:54.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: in the...

asr-007590
08:46:55.080 --> 08:46:56.080
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Color.

asr-007591
08:46:56.080 --> 08:46:57.080
