Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng kopya ng terms and conditions ng educational assistance program for decommissioned combatants.

asr-008387
09:19:34.120 --> 09:19:39.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ilalim nito, nakasaad na subject to availability of funds,

asr-008388
09:19:39.680 --> 09:19:42.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang pag-receive ng educational grants, no?

asr-008389
09:19:42.660 --> 09:19:46.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor, maaari bang ipaliwanag ito?

asr-008390
09:19:46.120 --> 09:19:52.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At hindi ba ito may ituring na isang conditionality na maaaring magdulot

asr-008391
09:19:52.500 --> 09:19:56.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ng pagkaantala sa pagbibigay ng educational grants?

asr-008392
09:19:56.200 --> 09:20:02.740
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Pwede pong pakiulit yung...

asr-008393
09:20:02.740 --> 09:20:03.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Sige po.

asr-008394
09:20:04.120 --> 09:20:10.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nasabi niyo po kasi kanina na dahil wala pa nga pong naibababa ang DBM sa inyo, no?

asr-008395
09:20:11.160 --> 09:20:13.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pero may targets kayo and may budget, tama?

asr-008396
09:20:15.140 --> 09:20:21.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In relation sa pagkaantala ng pagbibigay ng educational assistance or grants,

asr-008397
09:20:21.680 --> 09:20:22.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nakakuha ang aking opisina ng kopya ng terms and conditions...

asr-008398
09:20:22.200 --> 09:20:26.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nakakuha ang aking opisina ng kopya ng terms and conditions ng pagbibigay ng educational assistance or grants,

asr-008399
09:20:26.200 --> 09:20:40.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa ilalim nito, mayroon pong nakasaad na subject to availability of funds,

asr-008400
09:20:40.320 --> 09:20:43.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ang pagka-receive ng educational grants.

asr-008401
09:20:44.400 --> 09:20:54.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished sponsor, maaari bang ipaliwanag at hindi ba ito may ituturing na isang conditionality

asr-008402
09:20:54.200 --> 09:21:00.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na maaaring magdulot ng pagkaantala sa pagbibigay ng educational assistance?

asr-008403
09:21:10.780 --> 09:21:16.520
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Distinguished owner, yung funds po ay nasa DBM.

asr-008404
09:21:17.320 --> 09:21:19.360
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: It's beyond OPA Pro.

asr-008405
09:21:20.360 --> 09:21:21.440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang budget niyan.

asr-008406
09:21:21.440 --> 09:21:23.120
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So nagaantay lang po.

asr-008407
09:21:23.280 --> 09:21:23.440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Although...

asr-008408
09:21:24.200 --> 09:21:32.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ginagawa na rin pong mga hakbang ng OPA Pro sa MOA ng State Universities.

asr-008409
09:21:33.500 --> 09:21:38.100
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: But OPA Pro is waiting for the DBM to release.

asr-008410
09:21:40.140 --> 09:21:46.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngunit, base nga po doon sa condition ng educational assistance na ito,

asr-008411
09:21:46.800 --> 09:21:51.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: mayroon po kasing nakalagay na subject, subject for the availability of funds.

asr-008412
09:21:51.800 --> 09:21:53.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano yung ibig sabihin nun?

asr-008413
09:21:54.200 --> 09:21:58.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi ba napondohan na ito, ngunit hindi lang nadadownload?

asr-008414
09:21:58.880 --> 09:21:59.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yan.

asr-008415
09:21:59.280 --> 09:22:00.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And you are just waiting.

asr-008416
09:22:00.760 --> 09:22:06.420
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So ibig sabihin kung wala pong pondo mula sa DBM, wala rin pong mabibigay yung OPA Pro, tama po ba?

asr-008417
09:22:06.420 --> 09:22:12.940
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Hindi. Lahat naman po tayo, kahit tayo dito sa Congress, ay nakaano rin sa DBM.

asr-008418
09:22:13.760 --> 09:22:13.960
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Diba?

asr-008419
09:22:14.740 --> 09:22:16.020
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: So we'd like to have...

asr-008420
09:22:18.080 --> 09:22:23.040
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang ano po eh, kung pwedeng matulungan ng Kongreso, tayo ho.

asr-008421
09:22:23.040 --> 09:22:28.720
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Baka matulungan natin ng OPA Pro na ma-release yung pondo na inaantay nila.

asr-008422
09:22:29.180 --> 09:22:31.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, klaruhin ko lang po ha.

asr-008423
09:22:31.020 --> 09:22:36.680
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: May budget, pero kailangan. Ang cash wala pa.

asr-008424
09:22:37.040 --> 09:22:46.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes. Ang ibig sabihin po ng subject to availability of funds ay nagdidepende sa DBM kung kailan niya i-release sa inyo ang pondo.

asr-008425
09:22:46.340 --> 09:22:46.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes.

asr-008426
09:22:46.680 --> 09:22:48.360
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po. Maraming salamat po.

asr-008427
09:22:48.360 --> 09:22:51.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Finally, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-008428
09:22:51.520 --> 09:22:53.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Paano sisiguraduhin ng OPA?

asr-008429
09:22:53.040 --> 09:22:59.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: OPA Pro na matatanggap ng mga scholars ang kanilang grants sa mga susunod?

asr-008430
09:23:00.140 --> 09:23:06.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ang inyong mga mechanism sa pag-i-implement ng mga scholarship program or grants na ito?

asr-008431
09:23:06.360 --> 09:23:21.380
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Again, pingin sa kulig. Just like nung napag-usapan natin a while ago bago ng tanong, lahat ito depends sa pag-release ng pondo ng DBM.

asr-008432
09:23:21.380 --> 09:23:22.000
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Yes.

asr-008433
09:23:23.040 --> 09:23:36.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yan po nito, no, Mr. Sponsor. Ang akin lamang po ay ang katanungan ko ay particular sa OPA Pro na ano po kaya ang mekanismo ng i-implement nila para hindi na po mangyari ang mga ganito sa susunod.

asr-008434
09:23:36.300 --> 09:23:37.140
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ah, yung MOA po.

asr-008435
09:23:37.140 --> 09:23:43.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Alam ko na ang DBM po ang nag-re-release, ngunit on their part, ano pong ginagawa nila dito?

asr-008436
09:23:43.760 --> 09:23:51.760
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Nagkakaroon po ng tuloy-tuloy naman ang pakipag-communicate ng OPA Pro sa mga students.

asr-008437
09:23:53.040 --> 09:23:56.560
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Office of the President and sa mga estudyante, no?

asr-008438
09:23:58.360 --> 09:23:59.400
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sige po.

asr-008439
09:23:59.980 --> 09:24:10.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, ah, Mr. Speaker, ah, Mr. Sponsor, dadako naman po ako ngayon sa Transitional Justice and Reconciliation, yung roadmap po, no?

asr-008440
09:24:11.740 --> 09:24:21.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ah, Distinguished Sponsor, noong August 6 to 7, nag-convene po ang GPH Implementing Panels at MILFTWG

asr-008441
09:24:21.560 --> 09:24:30.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: on Transitional Justice and Reconciliation para i-resume ang discussion sa Transitional Justice and Reconciliation Roadmap.

asr-008442
09:24:32.080 --> 09:24:40.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maari po bang i-enumerate ang mga jointly identified activities at priority deliverables na napagkasunduan?

asr-008443
09:24:40.560 --> 09:24:50.560
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ah, updates on the transitional...

asr-008444
09:24:51.560 --> 09:24:53.360
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Transitional Justice, no?

asr-008445
09:24:53.940 --> 09:24:57.300
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Enhancements to file bills, no?

asr-008446
09:24:58.440 --> 09:25:09.340
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: HR and Senate was submitted to the Joint Implementing Panel by the GPH-MILFT Technical Working Group.

asr-008447
09:25:10.360 --> 09:25:17.440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Approval of the same is among the agenda in the Kuala Lumpur meeting.

asr-008448
09:25:17.440 --> 09:25:21.440
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Once approved by the Joint Panel, the document...

asr-008449
09:25:21.560 --> 09:25:30.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: We'll submit same for the proposed workshop, right shop, ah, here in the H.O.R., in the Senate,

asr-008450
09:25:30.840 --> 09:25:50.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to harmonize proposed NTJRCE, National Transformation, National Transitional Justice Reconciliation.

asr-008451
09:25:51.560 --> 09:25:58.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Maraming salamat po.

asr-008452
09:25:58.820 --> 09:26:04.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Babalikan ko yung sinabi niyo pong enhancement to file bills in H.O.R. and Senate.

asr-008453
09:26:04.580 --> 09:26:13.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Alam niyo po, Mr. Sponsor, dito po sa H.O.R., kami pa lang po sa Akbayan Reform Block ang nag-file ng T.J.R., no?

asr-008454
09:26:13.480 --> 09:26:21.180
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Siguro po, kung plano din po ito ng, o papro, enhancement to file bills on H.O.R. and Senate,

asr-008455
09:26:21.560 --> 09:26:31.200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sana po ay mas maipush ninyo pa po itong Kongreso, ang ating mga distinguished colleagues na mag-file or mag-co-author man lang po dito, no?

asr-008456
09:26:31.700 --> 09:26:35.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasi hindi po, sa ngayon po, hindi po kasi yun namin nakikita.

asr-008457
09:26:35.920 --> 09:26:42.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: We filed our bill last year, noong July pa, pero hanggang ngayon hindi pa rin po ito gumagalaw.

asr-008458
09:26:42.440 --> 09:26:45.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: We need the oppa pro to help us on this matter as well.

asr-008459
09:26:45.340 --> 09:26:51.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Huwag niyo pong isaalang-alang lang po dito sa Kongreso na kami lang ang gagalaw dito.

asr-008460
09:26:51.560 --> 09:26:56.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kailangan din po namin ito kasi ito po yung continuing process ninyo po, no?

asr-008461
09:26:56.540 --> 09:26:59.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, dadako naman po ako sa isa pang katanungan.

asr-008462
09:26:59.880 --> 09:27:06.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa mga na-identify na activities at priority deliverables ng oppa pro,

asr-008463
09:27:07.100 --> 09:27:12.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: confirm if meron silang budget under the 2027 para rito.

asr-008464
09:27:12.920 --> 09:27:15.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Lahat po nung nabanggit nyo kanina.

asr-008465
09:27:21.560 --> 09:27:39.000
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: For fiscal year 2027, 66 million has been allotted for the TGR aspect of the normalization program.

asr-008466
09:27:39.000 --> 09:27:51.000
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This includes 14 million for track 1 establishment of the NTJRCB and 51 million for track 2 support.

asr-008467
09:27:51.560 --> 09:27:55.880
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: To the four TGR pillars.

asr-008468
09:27:56.940 --> 09:28:07.960
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This includes programs, interventions such as parcelary land inventory of the areas inside the six MIL camps,

asr-008469
09:28:08.540 --> 09:28:18.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: engagements with both houses of Congress and key stakeholders for the passage of the NTJRCB bill

asr-008470
09:28:18.840 --> 09:28:20.840
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: and other interventions.

asr-008471
09:28:21.560 --> 09:28:30.460
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: In pursuit of the pillars on truth, history, justice, reparations, and guarantee.

asr-008472
09:28:31.320 --> 09:28:41.860
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: To fully deliver the commitments under the GPH-MILF-TGR roadmap, a total of 100 million is required.

asr-008473
09:28:42.300 --> 09:28:43.260
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Maraming salamat po.

asr-008474
09:28:43.260 --> 09:28:50.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po ay makareceive po tayo ng updates sa mga programs and activities na ito moving forward po, no?

asr-008475
09:28:51.560 --> 09:29:03.440
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Finally, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, ano-ano ang mga milestone or targets ng OPA-PRO in relation sa TGR roadmap para sa 2027 po?

asr-008477
09:29:32.300 --> 09:29:34.420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Distinguished colleague,

asr-008478
09:29:34.420 --> 09:29:38.260
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ang approval of the NTJRCB.

asr-008479
09:29:39.000 --> 09:29:49.900
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Also, the good secretary will be meeting soon with the office of the speaker or the speaker himself

asr-008480
09:29:49.900 --> 09:29:51.320
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: in regards to TGR projects.

asr-008484
09:29:51.560 --> 09:29:53.420
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: the bills that needs to be

asr-008485
09:29:53.420 --> 09:29:55.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: after

asr-008486
09:29:55.620 --> 09:29:57.620
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: the meeting in Kuala Lumpur.

asr-008487
09:29:58.020 --> 09:29:59.220
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: This is 25th.

asr-008488
09:30:00.000 --> 09:30:11.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, maraming salamat po. At nabalitaan ko rin na ito'y naging priority bill na rin po dito sa Kongreso. Kaya konting push na lang po mula sa OPAPRU din po.

asr-008489
09:30:12.560 --> 09:30:27.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway, Mr. Speaker, Mr. Sponsor, bilang panghuling paksa na tatanungin ko po sa inyo, yung tungkol po sa Women, Peace and Security, isang katanungan na lamang po.

asr-008490
09:30:27.800 --> 09:30:40.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Distinguished Sponsor, can you confirm kung magkano ang budget for Women, Peace and Security programs ng OPAPRU at ano-ano po ang mga programang saklaw nitong budget?

asr-008491
09:30:42.980 --> 09:30:45.800
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: 12,195,000.

asr-008492
09:30:48.320 --> 09:30:53.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano-ano po yung mga saklaw ng budget na ito, program ng mga budget?

asr-008493
09:30:53.900 --> 09:30:56.900
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Ito po, capacity building for local.

asr-008494
09:30:57.800 --> 09:31:15.280
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: And international partners, collaboration, partnership and resource mobilization, localization and mainstreaming, monitoring, evaluation, accountability and learning, and unit management and administrative services.

asr-008495
09:31:16.560 --> 09:31:17.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-008496
09:31:17.520 --> 09:31:27.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: This representation believes that the Women, Peace and Security programs are important in ensuring meaningful representation, participation,

asr-008497
09:31:27.800 --> 09:31:34.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: and leadership of women across all stages of the peace process and conflict transformation.

asr-008498
09:31:35.340 --> 09:31:42.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In closing, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, ang aming kritikal na pagsuporta ay may kasamang hamon.

asr-008499
09:31:43.520 --> 09:31:58.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Patunayan dapat ng OPAPRU na sa pamamagitan ng mabilis at tapat na serbisyo na bawat piso sa inyong budget ay tunay na napupunta sa kapakanan ng ating mga pamayanan

asr-008500
09:31:58.720 --> 09:32:03.320
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at mga decommissioned combatants at kanilang mga pamilya.

asr-008501
09:32:03.320 --> 09:32:19.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa ating mga kababayan, makakaasa kayong hindi kami titigil sa pagbabantay at pagtiyak na ang mga pangakong kapayapaan ay magbubungan ng totoong sekuridad at ginhawa sa inyong pangaraw-araw na buhay.

asr-008502
09:32:21.020 --> 09:32:21.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-008503
09:32:21.980 --> 09:32:24.920
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Makakaasa po kayo, distinguished colleague.

asr-008504
09:32:25.600 --> 09:32:27.700
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Lalong-lalo na sa ating bagong...

asr-008505
09:32:27.720 --> 09:32:29.700
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: kalihim sa OPA-PRO

asr-008506
