asr-008700
09:45:26.880 --> 09:45:34.760
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung saan 103 sa kanila ay inaresto sa ilalim ng panunungkulan ng kasulukuyang administrasyon.

asr-008701
09:45:35.440 --> 09:45:42.120
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mula rito, 147 ay kababaihan at mahigit kalahati ay mga magsasaka.

asr-008702
09:45:42.960 --> 09:45:50.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Meron ding 21 na kababaihan na biktima ng extrajudicial killings at 4 na kaso ng enforced disappearances.

asr-008703
09:45:50.640 --> 09:45:53.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Patuloy pa rin ang paghingi ng hustisya para sa mga comfort women,

asr-008704
09:45:53.880 --> 09:45:56.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: mga biktima ng military sexual violence,

asr-008705
09:45:56.880 --> 09:45:58.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: noong panahon ng hapon.

asr-008706
09:45:58.880 --> 09:46:02.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang paglaganap ng EDCA sites sa iba't-ibang bahagi ng Pilipinas

asr-008707
09:46:02.880 --> 09:46:09.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at ang tuloy-tuloy na joint military exercises sa U.S. at iba pang bansa ay patuloy na banta,

asr-008708
09:46:09.880 --> 09:46:15.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi lang sa siguridad, kundi nagiging vulnerable din ang mga kababaihan sa seksual na obuso

asr-008709
09:46:15.880 --> 09:46:18.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: at napatunayan na ito ng kasaysayan.

asr-008710
09:46:18.880 --> 09:46:25.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang mga isyong nabanggit ang nais nating ilagay sa liwanag sa usapin ng Women, Peace and Security.

asr-008711
09:46:26.880 --> 09:46:33.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Dahil we are aware of the four pillars ng Philippine National Action Plan on Women, Peace and Security,

asr-008712
09:46:33.880 --> 09:46:41.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: sa tingin po natin ang mga nabanggit ay hindi pa po nakakasama doon sa nalalatag sa iba't-ibang mga gawain ng OPAPRU.

asr-008713
09:46:41.880 --> 09:46:45.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Kaya naman po, continuously, Mr. Speaker, good sponsor,

asr-008714
09:46:45.880 --> 09:46:55.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: we'd like to manifest that we reject the use of women's bodies and communities as collateral in military alliances and war economies.

asr-008715
09:46:55.880 --> 09:47:02.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Mr. Speaker, good sponsor, hintayin na lang po natin ang mga ulat na nirequest ng kinatawan na ito.

asr-008716
09:47:02.880 --> 09:47:06.880
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: But for now, maraming salamat sa mga pagsagot sa tanong natin.

asr-008717
09:47:06.880 --> 09:47:11.630
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I yield to the floor my remaining time, Mr. Speaker.

asr-008718
09:47:11.640 --> 09:47:14.830
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much, Majority Leader.

asr-008719
09:47:14.840 --> 09:47:24.880
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Before that, Mr. Speaker, the OPAPRU wish to extend an invitation to the honorable members of this House,

asr-008720
09:47:25.880 --> 09:47:36.880
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: to OPAP office for more briefing with regards to women, peace, security.

asr-008721
09:47:36.880 --> 09:47:38.780
Rep. Jose "Joboy" S. Aquino II: Thank you, Mr. Speaker.

asr-008722
09:47:38.780 --> 09:47:40.300
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Salamat po, Mr. Sponsor.

asr-008724
09:47:40.300 --> 09:47:42.560
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Thank you very much, Majority Leader.

asr-008725
09:47:42.880 --> 09:47:51.880
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, next to interpellate the sponsor, I move that we recognize the honorable Presley C. De Jesus of Philreca Partylist.

asr-008726
09:47:51.880 --> 09:47:54.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The gentleman from Philreca Partylist, honorable Presley De Jesus.

asr-008727
09:47:55.880 --> 09:47:57.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Recognize.

asr-008728
09:47:57.880 --> 09:48:06.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Mr. Speaker, there being no more members of the minority who wish to interpellate,

asr-008729
09:48:06.880 --> 09:48:17.880
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I move to terminate the sponsorship and debate on the budget of OPAPRU.

asr-008730
09:48:17.880 --> 09:48:21.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Before I call the majority, thank you.

asr-008731
09:48:21.880 --> 09:48:24.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Before I call the majority, please be reminded, the Vice Chair Joboy,

asr-008732
09:48:24.880 --> 09:48:31.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: and the Department of the requested documents and promised documents to those who ask.

asr-008733
09:48:31.880 --> 09:48:34.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Majority Leader, what does the House say?

asr-008734
09:48:34.880 --> 09:48:41.880
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, on the part of the majority, we join the minority in the motion to terminate the period of interpellation

asr-008735
09:48:41.880 --> 09:48:50.400
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: on the proposed budget of the Office of the Presidential Advisor on Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity.

asr-008736
09:48:50.400 --> 09:48:53.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is a joint motion to terminate the interpellation of the proposed budget of the OPAPRU.

asr-008737
09:48:54.880 --> 09:48:57.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Is there any objection?

asr-008738
09:48:57.880 --> 09:48:58.880
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: There is none.

asr-008739
09:48:58.880 --> 09:49:11.520
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: The interpellation of the proposed budget of the Office of the Presidential Advisor on Peace, Reconciliation, and Unity is hereby terminated.

asr-008740
09:49:11.520 --> 09:49:13.800
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Congratulations.

asr-008742
09:49:13.800 --> 09:49:17.790
Rep. Katrina Reiko Chua-Tai: Mr. Speaker, I move that we suspend for a few minutes.

asr-008743
09:49:17.800 --> 09:49:21.160
Deputy Speaker Yevgeny Vincente B. Emano: Session suspended.

